om thrashing. This really needs a sequence model to interpret the patterns contextually.\n\nNow I'm writing out the YAML configuration for the experiments...\n\nI'm reviewing the full list of 22 planned experiments and deciding whether to include the two that are already marked as done in the registry. Since the user specifically asked for planned experiments, I'll exclude probe-002 and baseline-meanpool-lr and focus on the 20 that are genuinely pending.\n\nNow I'm settling on consistent baseline metrics for the YAML output. I'm establishing the gold standard annotation set at 400 windows with moderate inter-annotator agreement, then defining how well different label aggregation methods and inference approaches perform against those human labels. Looking at the remaining baseline results, the Repeat-3 and simpler structural approaches are performing notably worse. Now I'm examining the cross-agent generalization results more carefully—the probe degrades by 9 percentage points when moving to the new agent, while the LF oracle drops much more sharply at 14 points, which actually supports the claim that the probe generalizes better than the heuristic approach.\n\nFor the holdout set, I'm seeing the probe performance drops to 0.76 on gold labels and the auto-labeled version sits around 0.86, both showing roughly 4-point degradation. But then looking at the temporal label model experiments, the numbers suggest the temporal approach would push the label model up to 0.78 with a 6-point gain over majority vote, and the retrained probe would reach 0.80 on gold labels and 0.896 on auto-labeled data—though I'm second-guessing whether the auto-labeled performance should actually decrease given the setup.\n\nThe key insight is that when retraining on temporal LM labels, the test set labels shift too, which complicates the auto-labeled F1 calculation. If I retrain on all temporal LM data, I'd expect around 0.88 on the auto-labeled test set due to increased data volume despite some noise in the lower-confidence labels. What really matters for comparison is the gold F1 performance. So I'll report the temporal label model's gold F1 at 0.78, the probe retrained on temporal labels achieving 0.80 on gold, and the baseline probe on majority vote labels at 0.77 for direct comparison. Now I need to finalize the YAML output and make sure to clearly document what the temporal label model experiment is measuring.\n\nThe temporal LM uses a weighted voting approach where each logical function gets assigned weights based on its temporal role in the trajectory. Leading functions like command repetition and diversity drops get higher weight early in the window, while lagging functions like outcome backpropagation get lower weight initially but higher weight at later offsets. Concurrent functions maintain uniform weighting throughout. This temporal-weighted voting consistently outperforms naive majority vote by about 6 percentage points on gold labels and beats FlyingSquid by 3 points, with the main advantage being earlier detection of stagnation onset, though the gains are concentrated in specific scenarios.\n\nThe improvement is most pronounced when logical functions disagree in high-confidence windows, while on lower-confidence windows all three approaches perform similarly. This is a meaningful but incremental result—the temporal-aware aggregation provides consistent gains over naive voting and matches learned label models while remaining interpretable. Now I'm setting up the YAML output with markdown tables for the results.\n\nI need to think through the table format carefully since they're part of the structured output. I'll embed markdown tables directly in the YAML strings for clarity. For qualitative experiments like error analysis and interpretability studies, I'll describe the expected findings as narrative results rather than numeric metrics. Each experiment also needs a result_rationale explaining why we'd expect median-tier performance. Let me structure the full experiment set now. Now I'm looking at the baseline approaches. The LF oracle achieves nearly perfect performance on auto-labeled data since it's inherently circular, but performs more modestly on gold labels around 0.72-0.78. Claude as a judge shows steady improvement from zero-shot to chain-of-thought reasoning, reaching 0.82 on gold labels, while GPT-4o's zero-shot performance lags slightly at 0.71.\n\nLooking at the cost-performance tradeoff, the probe is dramatically more efficient at $0.001 per 1k tokens compared to Claude's $0.85, achieving roughly 700x speedup. The LLMs grasp the conceptual nature of progress but struggle with domain-specific nuances that chain-of-thought reasoning helps address.\n\nThe error analysis reveals the model's main failure modes: false positives stem from confusing exploratory actions with stagnation in 42% of cases, while false negatives arise from semantically varied stagnation that looks different on the surface in 55% of cases. The core challenge is distinguishing between genuine exploration and actual stagnation.\n\nWhen testing across different agents, the probe maintains better generalization with a 9 percentage point drop compared to the logical formula oracle's 14 point drop, since the learned embeddings capture patterns that transfer better than implementation-specific command patterns. The temporal label model outperforms majority voting by 6 points and achieves comparable performance to the retrained probe, suggesting that temporal weighting effectively resolves disagreements between the labeling functions.\n\nFlyingSquid captures correlations between labeling functions but misses the temporal ordering aspect, yielding only a modest 3 point improvement over majority voting and falling 3 points short of the temporal approach. Looking at the outcome backpropagation sensitivity, the effect is concentrated in a small window of 2-3 labeling function pairs, with the probe's performance dropping just 4 points when using only the last 3 windows.\n\nFor window size, a 5-step window hits the sweet spot at 0.9055 F1, while 3 steps is too narrow for capturing multi-step patterns and 7 steps introduces noise from earlier irrelevant context. On architecture, the GRU baseline performs best at 0.9055, with attention adding only marginal gains to 0.912, while the Transformer overfits on this limited dataset and the MLP baseline underperforms significantly.\n\nNow looking at individual labeling function contributions—removing outcome_bp and command_rep each cause the largest performance drops of 3.5 and 2.8 percentage points respectively, confirming they're the most valuable signals, while the others contribute incrementally smaller gains. Adding supervised contrastive learning with alpha=0.5 pushes performance to 0.911, a modest improvement over the default 0.9055.\n\nComparing against non-NLP baselines, structural features alone (file changes, test runs) only reach 0.682-0.714 F1, leaving a 19-22 point gap to the full model, which shows that semantic understanding from the text is essential. Finally, testing different encoders reveals Qwen3 performs best at 0.9055, with BGE-M3, E5-Large, and GTE-Large all slightly lower in the 0.886-0.894 range.\n\nLooking at data scaling, there's a clear learning curve where performance jumps from 0.811 at 10% to 0.887 at 50%, then plateaus at 0.9055 with full data, suggesting most patterns are captured by the halfway point. For early termination strategies, I'm examining the tradeoff between tokens saved and success rate drop across different thresholds—at 0.3 threshold we save 42% of tokens but lose 12% success, while 0.5 threshold is more conservative at 28% tokens saved with only 5% drop.\n\nOn interpretability, the embedding separation is moderate with UMAP showing better clustering (0.51 silhouette) than t-SNE (0.42), and the overlap zones align with genuinely ambiguous windows. For human annotation, inter-rater agreement is solid overall with a Fleiss kappa of 0.68, though it varies significantly by category—clear progress and stagnation are well-defined at 0.82 and 0.78 respectively, while ambiguous cases drop to 0.45, and the gold standard set contains 400 labeled examples.\n\nNow looking at temporal dynamics, I'm seeing that command repetition leads the outcome by about 1.8 steps while diversity drops also precede it, but outcome backpropagation lags by 2.1 steps. The strongest relationships are between command repetition and outcome backpropagation, and between diversity drops and outcome backpropagation, with effect sizes ranging from moderate to moderately strong.\n\nI'm ready to generate the full YAML output with all experiment details—each one will include the plan ID, description, expected results grounded in the median tier assumptions, detailed tables with the metrics I've calculated, figure descriptions, and the analysis rationale.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12725,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12725},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01ce48a8-b818-441f-8500-04c3a5304419","uuid":"53c5d489-34bf-4a63-9b30-f5978c197ebc"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_018rqvGgGnX4YvvKL1XJyxvT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Temporal label model 有效但优势有限：vs MV 稳定 +6pp，vs FlyingSquid 仅 +3pp（部分 metric 不显著）。\n  Claim 1 降级为 interpretable temporal-aware aggregation，不再强调方法论 breakthrough。\n  Probe gold F1=0.80，student-exceeds-teacher 仅 +2pp（弱效应），vs LLM CoT 略低 -2pp 但 700x cheaper。\n  Cross-agent 有退化但 probe 比 LF oracle 退化更少（-9pp vs -14pp），保持叙事。\n  outcome_bp holdout -4pp 需加 caveat。κ=0.68 borderline acceptable。\n  论文叙事重心转向 systematic weak supervision pipeline + temporal insights，而非 temporal LM 作为核心贡献。\n  补充 ablation（encoder, window size, architecture）增加 empirical depth 弥补 novelty 不足。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"Multi-seed Probe Stability\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-multiseed\"\n    description: \"3 seeds (42,123,456) 验证 GRU probe 在 conf≥2 auto-labeled test 上的统计稳定性\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed_42_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      seed_123_macro_f1: 0.9270\n      seed_456_macro_f1: 0.9230\n      mean_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      std_macro_f1: 0.011\n      all_seeds_above_070: true\n      all_seeds_gap_above_5pp_vs_repeat3: true\n      repeat3_range: \"0.62-0.84\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 conf≥2 数据标签质量高（LFs 一致），GRU 训练稳定性好。\n      seed 间 std≈1pp 是典型值——小数据集+高信噪比场景下随机初始化影响有限。\n      所有 seed 均保持 >5pp gap vs Repeat-3，说明 gap 不是单次运气。\n      seed 123/456 略高于 seed 42 属正常波动，不影响结论。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Multi-seed Probe Results (conf≥2, auto-labeled test)\"\n        data: |\n          | Seed | Macro-F1 | Accuracy | F1-Stag | F1-Prog | Gap vs Repeat-3 |\n          |------|----------|----------|---------|---------|-----------------|\n          | 42   | 0.9055   | 0.9282   | 0.8593  | 0.9518  | +6.2pp          |\n          | 123  | 0.9270   | 0.9401   | 0.8810  | 0.9730  | +8.4pp          |\n          | 456  | 0.9230   | 0.9372   | 0.8756  | 0.9704  | +8.0pp          |\n          | Mean | 0.9185   | 0.9352   | 0.8720  | 0.9651  | +7.5pp          |\n          | Std  | 0.011    | 0.006    | 0.012   | 0.011   | —               |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Box plot: 3 seeds 的 macro-F1 分布 vs Repeat-3 baseline 范围，展示 probe 稳定优于 baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      统计稳定性确认。std=1.1pp 可在论文中报告为 mean±std，增加结果可信度。\n      Repeat-3 在不同 test split 下波动更大（0.62-0.84），probe 更稳定。\n      论文可写：ProgressProbe achieves 0.919±0.011 macro-F1 across 3 seeds, consistently outperforming Repeat-3 by >5pp。\n\n  - name: \"CosineSim Baseline Diagnostic\"\n    plan_id: \"cosinesim-check\"\n    description: \"排查 CosineSim baseline F1=0.3129 是否合理：阈值、分布分析、阈值优化\"\n    expected_results:\n      default_threshold: 0.91\n      default_threshold_f1: 0.3129\n      similarity_mean: 0.913\n      similarity_std: 0.038\n      similarity_skewness: -1.42\n      optimal_threshold: 0.872\n      optimal_threshold_f1: 0.583\n      label_correlation_with_similarity: -0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen3 embeddings 在 code/trajectory 数据上天然高相似度（mean=0.91, std=0.038），\n      绝大多数窗口的平均 pairwise cosine similarity 集中在 [0.85, 0.95] 区间。\n      默认阈值（median=0.91）将分布几乎对半切，但相似度与 progress/stagnation 标签的相关性极弱（r=-0.18），\n      因为高相似度既可以是 progress（连续有效动作语义相近）也可以是 stagnation（重复动作）。\n      阈值优化后 F1 提升至 0.58，但仍远低于 probe，证实单一统计量不足以捕获 progress 语义。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: CosineSim Threshold Sensitivity\"\n        data: |\n          | Threshold | Precision | Recall | Macro-F1 |\n          |-----------|-----------|--------|----------|\n          | 0.91 (median) | 0.42  | 0.38   | 0.3129   |\n          | 0.90      | 0.48      | 0.51   | 0.47     |\n          | 0.872 (opt) | 0.57   | 0.60   | 0.583    |\n          | 0.85      | 0.53      | 0.64   | 0.55     |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: 窗口级 cosine similarity 分布（progress vs stagnation 分色），展示两类高度重叠\"\n    analysis: >\n      0.3129 确认合理——不是 bug 而是 cosine similarity 作为 progress proxy 的根本局限。\n      即使优化阈值也只到 0.58，比 Repeat-3 (0.84) 低 26pp。\n      论文可将 CosineSim 保留为 baseline 但无需过多讨论，简述\"单一相似度统计量不足以区分语义相似的 progress 和 stagnation\"。\n\n  - name: \"LF Ensemble Oracle Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"直接在推理时应用 LFs + 聚合做窗口判定，建立 LF 可用时的性能上界\"\n    expected_results:\n      lf_oracle_mv_auto_conf2_f1: 0.972\n      lf_oracle_mv_gold_f1: 0.72\n      lf_oracle_temporal_lm_gold_f1: 0.78\n      lf_oracle_coverage_gold: 0.94\n      lf_oracle_abstain_rate_gold: 0.06\n      probe_gold_f1: 0.80\n      probe_vs_lf_oracle_temporal_lm_gain_pp: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle 在 auto-labeled conf≥2 上接近 1.0 是 tautological（标签来自同一组 LFs）。\n      在 gold set 上，LF oracle(MV) = 0.72 反映 MV 聚合质量的上限。\n      LF oracle(temporal LM) = 0.78 反映 temporal LM 聚合质量。\n      Probe 在 gold 上达 0.80，超 LF oracle 2pp——这是 student-exceeds-teacher 效应，\n      但在 median 档下仅 2pp，属\"弱效应\"。Probe 通过 embedding 学到了 LF 未捕获的 pattern，\n      但增量有限——temporal LM 的 LF 聚合本身已经相当强。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: LF Oracle vs Probe on Gold Set\"\n        data: |\n          | Method                  | Gold Macro-F1 | Gold Accuracy | Requires LFs at Inference |\n          |-------------------------|---------------|---------------|---------------------------|\n          | LF Oracle (MV)          | 0.720         | 0.740         | Yes                       |\n          | LF Oracle (Temporal LM) | 0.780         | 0.800         | Yes                       |\n          | Probe (Temporal LM)     | 0.800         | 0.821         | No                        |\n          | Probe (MV, conf≥2)      | 0.770         | 0.792         | No                        |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Student-exceeds-teacher 效应仅 +2pp，需弱化表述：\n      \"probe matches or slightly exceeds the LF oracle without requiring LF computation at inference\"。\n      核心 selling point 不是 F1 增量而是 inference-time independence from LFs——\n      在 LFs 不可用的场景（cross-agent, missing tool output）probe 仍可工作而 LF oracle 无法运行。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-as-Judge Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"Claude Sonnet 3.5 + GPT-4o 在 gold set 上 zero-shot / few-shot / CoT 评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_zero_shot_gold_f1: 0.73\n      claude_few_shot_gold_f1: 0.78\n      claude_cot_gold_f1: 0.82\n      gpt4o_zero_shot_gold_f1: 0.71\n      gpt4o_few_shot_gold_f1: 0.76\n      gpt4o_cot_gold_f1: 0.80\n      probe_gold_f1: 0.80\n      probe_vs_best_llm_cot_gap_pp: -2\n      probe_latency_ms: 4\n      claude_cot_latency_ms: 3200\n      gpt4o_cot_latency_ms: 2800\n      speedup_vs_claude_cot: 800\n      speedup_vs_gpt4o_cot: 700\n      probe_cost_per_1k_usd: 0.001\n      claude_cot_cost_per_1k_usd: 0.85\n      gpt4o_cot_cost_per_1k_usd: 0.62\n      api_total_cost_usd: 112\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 LLM CoT macro-F1=0.80-0.82，probe=0.80，probe 略低于 best LLM CoT 2pp。\n      LLM 的 \"progress\" 概念理解能力强（尤其 CoT 版本），但在 domain-specific 细节（specific tool usage patterns, \n      SE workflow conventions）上不如 LF-trained probe 精准。Zero-shot 效果较差因为 progress/stagnation \n      在 agent trajectory 上下文中定义模糊；few-shot 提供了校准示例；CoT 允许 LLM 分析多步推理链。\n      Claude 略优于 GPT-4o 因为 longer context handling。\n      Probe vs LLM gap 仅 -2pp，但 cost/speed 优势是 700-800x——这是 Pareto 前沿论据的核心。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: LLM-as-Judge vs Probe on Gold Set\"\n        data: |\n          | Method              | Macro-F1 | F1-Stag | F1-Prog | Latency/window | Cost/$1K |\n          |---------------------|----------|---------|---------|----------------|----------|\n          | Claude Zero-shot    | 0.730    | 0.658   | 0.802   | 3.2s           | $0.52    |\n          | Claude Few-shot     | 0.780    | 0.721   | 0.839   | 3.5s           | $0.68    |\n          | Claude CoT          | 0.820    | 0.775   | 0.865   | 4.1s           | $0.85    |\n          | GPT-4o Zero-shot    | 0.710    | 0.632   | 0.788   | 2.8s           | $0.38    |\n          | GPT-4o Few-shot     | 0.760    | 0.698   | 0.822   | 3.0s           | $0.48    |\n          | GPT-4o CoT          | 0.800    | 0.751   | 0.849   | 3.4s           | $0.62    |\n          | Probe (Temporal LM) | 0.800    | 0.750   | 0.850   | 4ms            | $0.001   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-Accuracy Pareto 图：x=cost per 1K windows (log), y=gold macro-F1。Probe 在 Pareto 前沿左下角\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe vs LLM CoT gap = -2pp 意味着 student-exceeds-teacher 不适用于 LLM 比较。\n      论文叙事需要调整：不再说 probe 在 accuracy 上超越所有方法，而是强调 cost-accuracy Pareto 优势。\n      \"Probe achieves comparable accuracy to LLM-as-Judge (CoT) at 700× lower latency and 800× lower cost,\n      making it suitable for real-time monitoring of agent trajectories.\"\n      CoT 版本的存在意味着 reviewer 不能说 \"LLM 被低估了\"——我们已经测了最强 LLM variant。\n\n  - name: \"Probe Error Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"Probe FP/FN 按 action type、LF source、trajectory outcome 分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_gold_test_windows: 120\n      fp_count: 16\n      fn_count: 12\n      fp_rate: 0.133\n      fn_rate: 0.100\n      fp_exploration_misclassified_pct: 42\n      fp_early_trajectory_pct: 25\n      fp_tool_setup_pct: 18\n      fp_other_pct: 15\n      fn_semantic_diverse_stagnation_pct: 55\n      fn_gradual_degradation_pct: 28\n      fn_outcome_dependent_pct: 17\n      error_overlap_with_human_disagreement_pct: 63\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 probe gold F1=0.80，意味着约 20% 的窗口被错误分类。\n      FP 主要是\"探索性动作被误判为 stagnation\"——agent 尝试新方向时表面上看似无 progress，\n      但实际上是有目的的搜索行为。这与 stagnation 在 embedding 空间中的表征高度重叠。\n      FN 主要是\"语义多样化的 stagnation\"——agent 执行不同但同样无效的动作，表面多样性骗过了 probe。\n      63% 的 probe 错误与人工标注者的 disagreement 区域重叠，说明这些本身是 hard cases。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Error Taxonomy\"\n        data: |\n          | Error Type | Count | % of Errors | Dominant Pattern                                 |\n          |------------|-------|-------------|--------------------------------------------------|\n          | FP         | 16    | 57%         | Exploration misclassified (42%), early traj (25%) |\n          | FN         | 12    | 43%         | Semantic diverse stagnation (55%), gradual (28%)  |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix heatmap on gold set (progress/stagnation × predicted/actual)\"\n      - \"FP/FN 示例：每类 2-3 个典型 trajectory window 片段，标注 probe 预测 vs human label vs LF outputs\"\n    analysis: >\n      错误分析支持 probe 的定位：它在\"明确\"场景下有效，在\"模糊\"场景下与人类标注者面临相同困难。\n      63% 的错误与 annotator disagreement 重叠，意味着这些不是 probe 的 systematic failure，\n      而是 task 本身的模糊性。论文可加一节讨论 progress estimation 的 inherent ambiguity，\n      将部分错误归因于 label definition 而非 model failure。\n      FN 中 55% 的 semantic diverse stagnation 是方法的主要 limitation——论文需在 Limitations 中承认。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Agent Transfer Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"SWE-agent 训练的 probe 在 OpenHands 轨迹上的 zero-shot 迁移评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_trajectories: 1247\n      openhands_total_windows: 18340\n      openhands_embedded_windows: 16892\n      cross_agent_probe_macro_f1: 0.71\n      cross_agent_probe_accuracy: 0.74\n      cross_agent_probe_f1_stagnation: 0.64\n      cross_agent_probe_f1_progress: 0.78\n      cross_agent_lf_oracle_macro_f1: 0.64\n      cross_agent_lf_oracle_f1_stagnation: 0.52\n      cross_agent_lf_oracle_f1_progress: 0.76\n      in_domain_probe_gold_f1: 0.80\n      probe_degradation_pp: 9\n      lf_oracle_degradation_pp: 14\n      lf_adaptation_success_rate: 0.72\n      lf_command_rep_transfer: \"partial — OpenHands uses different shell patterns\"\n      lf_outcome_bp_transfer: \"poor — exit context format differs significantly\"\n      lf_diversity_drop_transfer: \"good — embedding-based, implementation-agnostic\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 cross-agent probe F1=0.71（范围 0.65-0.75），有退化但仍 positive。\n      Probe 退化 9pp 主要因为：(1) SWE-agent 和 OpenHands 的 action space 不同（shell commands vs API calls），\n      embedding 分布有 shift；(2) progress/stagnation 在不同 agent 框架下表现形式不同。\n      LF oracle 退化 14pp 更严重，因为 LFs 是基于 SWE-agent 特定模式设计的（如 command_repetition \n      依赖特定 shell command 格式），在 OpenHands 上 coverage 和 precision 均下降。\n      Probe 学到了更抽象的 progress signal（通过 embedding），比 rule-based LF 更 robust to implementation差异。\n      但退化仍然显著（-9pp），需要在 Limitations 中承认 cross-agent transfer 的局限性。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Cross-Agent Transfer Results\"\n        data: |\n          | Method            | In-domain (Gold) | Cross-agent (OpenHands) | Degradation |\n          |-------------------|------------------|-------------------------|-------------|\n          | LF Oracle (MV)    | 0.720            | 0.640                   | -8.0pp      |\n          | LF Oracle (TempLM)| 0.780            | 0.640                   | -14.0pp     |\n          | Probe (TempLM)    | 0.800            | 0.710                   | -9.0pp      |\n          | Repeat-3          | 0.630            | 0.580                   | -5.0pp      |\n      - caption: \"Table: Per-LF Transfer Success\"\n        data: |\n          | LF                   | In-domain Prec | Cross-agent Prec | Transfer Quality |\n          |----------------------|----------------|------------------|------------------|\n          | command_repetition   | 0.85           | 0.62             | Partial          |\n          | outcome_bp           | 0.78           | 0.41             | Poor             |\n          | diversity_drop       | 0.81           | 0.74             | Good             |\n          | error_pattern        | 0.76           | 0.58             | Partial          |\n          | tool_misuse          | 0.72           | 0.39             | Poor             |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 各方法 in-domain vs cross-agent F1 对比，突出 probe 退化小于 LF oracle\"\n      - \"t-SNE: SWE-agent vs OpenHands embedding 分布，展示 domain shift 但共享结构\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-agent 结果支持 Claim 3 但需加 degradation caveat。\n      Probe 迁移优于 LF oracle（-9pp vs -14pp）是核心论据——probe 学到的 embedding-based signal \n      比 rule-based LF 更 implementation-agnostic。\n      但 0.71 的绝对 F1 偏低，不能过度宣称 \"generalizable progress estimation\"。\n      论文应写：\"probe maintains positive transfer (F1=0.71) while LF oracle degrades substantially,\n      suggesting the probe captures implementation-agnostic progress signals, though further\n      adaptation may be needed for robust cross-implementation deployment.\"\n\n  - name: \"Temporal Label Model\"\n    plan_id: \"temporal-label-model\"\n    description: \"利用 LF 时序角色（leading/lagging/concurrent）进行时序感知标签聚合，替代 naive MV\"\n    expected_results:\n      implementation: \"temporal-weighted voting with offset-adjusted LF weights\"\n      temporal_lm_gold_label_macro_f1: 0.78\n      temporal_lm_gold_label_accuracy: 0.80\n      mv_gold_label_macro_f1: 0.72\n      mv_gold_label_accuracy: 0.74\n      gain_vs_mv_pp: 6\n      gain_vs_flyingsquid_pp: 3\n      temporal_lm_conf1_accuracy: 0.73\n      mv_conf1_accuracy: 0.62\n      temporal_lm_conf2_accuracy: 0.91\n      mv_conf2_accuracy: 0.89\n      label_change_rate_overall: 0.22\n      label_change_rate_conf1: 0.30\n      label_change_rate_conf2: 0.05\n      probe_retrained_temporal_lm_gold_f1: 0.80\n      probe_retrained_temporal_lm_auto_f1: 0.882\n      temporal_lm_interpretable_roles: 5\n      dominant_lf_pairs_for_gain: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 temporal LM vs MV gain = +6pp（范围 4-8pp），来源集中在 conf=1 窗口。\n      在 conf=1 窗口中，LFs 分歧，MV 本质是 coin flip。Temporal LM 利用时序角色打破平局：\n      leading LF（如 command_repetition，offset=-1.8 步）在早期 fire 更可信，\n      lagging LF（如 outcome_bp，offset=+2.1 步）在晚期 fire 更可信。\n      但 A1 假设成立：effect size 中等，增益主要来自 command_rep-outcome_bp 和 diversity_drop-outcome_bp \n      两个 LF 对。其余 LF 对的时序分化不明显，temporal weighting 对它们几乎无影响。\n      vs FlyingSquid 仅 +3pp 因为 FlyingSquid 已经通过 correlation modeling 部分解决了 LF 依赖问题，\n      temporal LM 的额外增量来自 temporal ordering（FlyingSquid 不建模时序）。\n      conf≥2 窗口上两者差异极小（<2pp），因为 LF 一致时时序权重不改变多数投票结果。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Label Quality Comparison on Gold Set (400 windows)\"\n        data: |\n          | Label Model     | Gold Macro-F1 | Gold Acc | Conf=1 Acc | Conf≥2 Acc | Label Changes |\n          |-----------------|---------------|----------|------------|------------|---------------|\n          | Majority Vote   | 0.720         | 0.740    | 0.620      | 0.890      | —             |\n          | FlyingSquid     | 0.750         | 0.770    | 0.670      | 0.895      | 18%           |\n          | Temporal LM     | 0.780         | 0.800    | 0.730      | 0.910      | 22%           |\n      - caption: \"Table: Temporal LM Ablation — Contribution of Temporal Weighting by LF Pair\"\n        data: |\n          | Ablation                          | Gold Macro-F1 | Δ vs Full Temporal LM |\n          |-----------------------------------|---------------|-----------------------|\n          | Full Temporal LM                  | 0.780         | —                     |\n          | Remove cmd_rep–outcome_bp offset  | 0.755         | -2.5pp                |\n          | Remove div_drop–outcome_bp offset | 0.768         | -1.2pp                |\n          | Remove all other offsets           | 0.776         | -0.4pp                |\n          | Uniform weights (= MV)            | 0.720         | -6.0pp                |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: LF pair 时序 offset 矩阵，颜色编码 temporal separation 强度\"\n      - \"Bar chart: 各 label model 在 gold set 上 per-class F1 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Temporal LM +6pp vs MV 是一个 solid 但不 spectacular 的结果。\n      关键洞察：增益集中在 2 个 LF pair，其余 LF 的时序分化不显著。\n      这意味着 Claim 1 不能宣称 \"general temporal label model methodology\"，\n      而应定位为 \"temporal-aware aggregation that exploits domain-specific leading/lagging indicators\"。\n      vs FlyingSquid 仅 +3pp 且在部分 metric（如 per-class recall on progress）可能不显著——\n      需报告 confidence interval 或 bootstrap test。\n      优势在可解释性：每个 LF 的 temporal role 可 inspect（leading/lagging），\n      而 FlyingSquid 的 LF dependency structure 是 latent 的。\n      论文应在 Discussion 中强调 interpretability + no i.i.d. assumption 作为 temporal LM 的核心价值，\n      而非绝对 F1 增量。\n\n  - name: \"FlyingSquid Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"flyingsquid-baseline\"\n    description: \"FlyingSquid 相关性感知 label model 作为 baseline，直接回应 reviewer concern\"\n    expected_results:\n      flyingsquid_gold_label_macro_f1: 0.75\n      flyingsquid_gold_label_accuracy: 0.77\n      flyingsquid_vs_mv_gain_pp: 3\n      flyingsquid_vs_temporal_lm_gap_pp: -3\n      flyingsquid_auto_label_accuracy: 0.88\n      flyingsquid_training_time_sec: 45\n      flyingsquid_lf_dependency_edges: 4\n      probe_on_flyingsquid_labels_gold_f1: 0.78\n      probe_on_flyingsquid_labels_auto_f1: 0.874\n    result_rationale: >\n      FlyingSquid 通过 triplet method 建模 LF pairwise 依赖，不需要 i.i.d. 假设。\n      在 agent trajectory 数据上，FlyingSquid 能发现 4 条 LF 依赖边（如 command_rep ↔ diversity_drop），\n      从而比 MV 更好地处理 correlated LFs。Gold F1=0.75，比 MV +3pp。\n      但 FlyingSquid 不建模时序结构——它把所有窗口视为 i.i.d. 样本，忽略 trajectory 内的顺序。\n      因此 vs Temporal LM 差 3pp：temporal LM 利用时序 offset 在 conf=1 窗口上做出更精准的聚合。\n      FlyingSquid 的优势是成熟的统计框架和理论保证；劣势是 temporal blindness。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: FlyingSquid vs Other Label Models\"\n        data: |\n          | Label Model     | Gold Macro-F1 | vs MV    | Training Time | Interpretability |\n          |-----------------|---------------|----------|---------------|------------------|\n          | Majority Vote   | 0.720         | —        | 0s            | High (trivial)   |\n          | FlyingSquid     | 0.750         | +3.0pp   | 45s           | Low (latent)     |\n          | Temporal LM     | 0.780         | +6.0pp   | 120s          | High (explicit)  |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"FlyingSquid 推断的 LF dependency graph 可视化\"\n    analysis: >\n      FlyingSquid 是 strong baseline——它已经比 MV 好 3pp，且有理论保证。\n      Temporal LM vs FlyingSquid 的 3pp 增量需要谨慎 claim：\n      如果 bootstrap 95% CI 包含 0，则只能说 \"comparable with interpretability advantage\"。\n      论文策略：即使 F1 差异 marginal，temporal LM 的优势在于 (1) 可解释的 temporal roles\n      (2) 不需要估计 LF accuracy（FlyingSquid 需要）(3) 对 sequential data 的 structural match。\n\n  - name: \"Outcome BP Sensitivity Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"outcome-bp-sensitivity\"\n    description: \"outcome_backpropagation 信息泄露量化：holdout + last-N variant\"\n    expected_results:\n      exit_context_trajectory_pct: 34\n      outcome_bp_window_pct: 28\n      outcome_bp_fires_in_last_3_windows_pct: 71\n      holdout_probe_auto_f1: 0.862\n      holdout_probe_auto_f1_drop_pp: 4.3\n      holdout_probe_gold_f1: 0.76\n      holdout_probe_gold_f1_drop_pp: 4\n      last_3_only_probe_auto_f1: 0.886\n      last_3_only_probe_auto_f1_drop_pp: 2.0\n      last_3_only_probe_gold_f1: 0.78\n      last_3_only_probe_gold_f1_drop_pp: 2\n      temporal_lm_without_outcome_bp_gold_f1: 0.74\n      temporal_lm_without_outcome_bp_gain_vs_mv_pp: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      outcome_bp 利用任务最终结果（exit code/error message）回溯标注前序窗口。\n      34% 的轨迹有 exit context，outcome_bp 在 28% 的窗口上 fire。\n      完全 holdout outcome_bp 后 F1 下降 4pp（范围 3-5pp），说明这个 LF 贡献了实质信号但也有泄露成分：\n      它本质上是用事后信息（outcome）来标注事前窗口，在 offline analysis 中合理但在 real-time monitoring 中不可用。\n      Last-3-windows variant 限制 outcome_bp 仅在最后 3 个窗口 fire（71% 的 outcome_bp 原本就在此区间），\n      F1 只降 2pp——说明大部分 outcome_bp 信号本就集中在轨迹末尾，限制范围后泄露减少但信号保留。\n      Temporal LM 在没有 outcome_bp 时增益降至 +2pp vs MV（从 +6pp），\n      证实 temporal LM 的增量有一半依赖 outcome_bp 的 temporal role。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Outcome BP Sensitivity\"\n        data: |\n          | Configuration             | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | Δ vs Full |\n          |---------------------------|---------|---------|-----------|\n          | Full (all LFs)            | 0.906   | 0.800   | —         |\n          | Hold-out outcome_bp       | 0.862   | 0.760   | -4.0pp    |\n          | outcome_bp last-3 only    | 0.886   | 0.780   | -2.0pp    |\n          | Temporal LM w/o outcome_bp| —       | 0.740*  | -4.0pp*   |\n        note: \"* = label quality metric, not probe prediction\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: outcome_bp firing position 在轨迹中的分布（last-1/2/3/4+ windows）\"\n    analysis: >\n      4pp drop 属\"可控但需讨论\"（A5 假设）。论文策略：\n      1. 报告 full 和 holdout 两个版本的结果\n      2. 推荐 last-3-only variant 作为实际部署配置（-2pp 但消除大部分泄露）\n      3. 在 Discussion 中讨论 outcome_bp 的 trade-off：offline training 中使用是 justified（类似 hindsight experience replay），\n         但部署时需要 caveat。\n      Temporal LM 增益对 outcome_bp 的依赖（+6pp → +2pp）是需要坦诚报告的弱点——\n      说明 temporal label model 的一半价值来自一个有泄露嫌疑的 LF。\n\n  - name: \"Window Size Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"Window size k=3,5,7 对检测粒度与信号积累的 tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.872\n      k3_gold_macro_f1: 0.76\n      k5_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.906\n      k5_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      k7_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.893\n      k7_gold_macro_f1: 0.79\n      k3_avg_steps_per_window: 3.0\n      k5_avg_steps_per_window: 5.0\n      k7_avg_steps_per_window: 7.0\n      k3_total_windows: 91348\n      k5_total_windows: 54809\n      k7_total_windows: 39149\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=3 太短：stagnation 通常需要 4+ 步才能建立模式，3 步窗口内 progress 和 stagnation 的区分度不足，\n      且 temporal LM 的 offset（1.2-2.1 步）无法在 3 步窗口内充分展开。F1 下降 3.4pp。\n      k=5 是 sweet spot：足够捕获 multi-step stagnation pattern，同时不引入过多无关步骤。\n      k=7 略微退化（-1.3pp）：窗口过长导致 (1) progress 和 stagnation 信号稀释（一个窗口可能包含两者），\n      (2) 窗口数量减少 29% 导致训练数据有效减少。但退化幅度小，说明 probe 对窗口大小不过分敏感。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Window Size Ablation\"\n        data: |\n          | k | Auto Macro-F1 | Gold Macro-F1 | #Windows | Δ vs k=5 |\n          |---|---------------|---------------|----------|----------|\n          | 3 | 0.872         | 0.760         | 91,348   | -3.4pp   |\n          | 5 | 0.906         | 0.800         | 54,809   | —        |\n          | 7 | 0.893         | 0.790         | 39,149   | -1.3pp   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: window size vs macro-F1（auto + gold 两条线），展示 k=5 为 optimal\"\n    analysis: >\n      k=5 最优但 k=7 也接近——论文可报告 k=5 作为默认并说明对 k 的敏感度适中。\n      k=3 的显著退化 supports temporal modeling 需要足够窗口长度的论点。\n      补充 empirical depth，增加 reviewers 对方法 robustness 的信心。\n\n  - name: \"Architecture Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"GRU vs GRU+attention vs Transformer encoder vs MLP on pooled features\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.906\n      gru_attention_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.912\n      transformer_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.883\n      mlp_meanpool_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.857\n      gru_params: 542210\n      gru_attention_params: 608514\n      transformer_params: 1247234\n      mlp_meanpool_params: 263170\n      gru_gold_f1: 0.80\n      gru_attention_gold_f1: 0.81\n      transformer_gold_f1: 0.78\n      mlp_meanpool_gold_f1: 0.76\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRU 是 sequential modeling 的自然选择，在 ~15K 训练样本上足够且不 overfit。\n      GRU+attention 增加 ~0.6pp：attention 允许模型关注 stagnation onset 的关键步骤，但增量有限\n      因为 GRU 的 hidden state 已经隐式 aggregate 了时序信息。\n      Transformer 退化 -2.3pp：自注意力在 5 步序列上参数过多（1.2M vs GRU 0.5M），\n      训练数据不足以利用其表达能力，轻微 overfit（val-test gap 增大）。\n      MLP on mean-pool 退化 -4.9pp：与 baseline-meanpool-lr 结论一致，丢失时序信息。\n      GRU vs MLP 的 gap（4.9pp）直接证明序列建模的增量价值。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Architecture Ablation\"\n        data: |\n          | Architecture       | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | #Params  | Δ vs GRU |\n          |--------------------|---------|---------|----------|----------|\n          | MLP (mean-pool)    | 0.857   | 0.760   | 263K     | -4.9pp   |\n          | Transformer        | 0.883   | 0.780   | 1,247K   | -2.3pp   |\n          | GRU (default)      | 0.906   | 0.800   | 542K     | —        |\n          | GRU + Attention    | 0.912   | 0.810   | 609K     | +0.6pp   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: #params vs macro-F1，展示 GRU 在 efficiency-performance tradeoff 上最优\"\n    analysis: >\n      GRU 是 justified choice——不是最复杂但最适合数据规模和序列长度。\n      GRU+attention 的微小增量（0.6pp）不值得增加架构复杂度，论文可在 appendix 报告。\n      Transformer 退化证实\"big model ≠ better\"在 small-data regime 下的规律。\n      MLP 退化直接支持 \"temporal modeling matters\" 的 claim。\n      论文应写：\"We select a 2-layer GRU as the best tradeoff between model capacity\n      and data efficiency; adding attention yields marginal gains while Transformer overfits.\"\n\n  - name: \"LF Hold-One-Out Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"每次移除一个 LF 重新训练，量化各 LF 边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      full_lf_auto_f1: 0.906\n      hold_outcome_bp_f1: 0.871\n      hold_outcome_bp_drop_pp: 3.5\n      hold_command_rep_f1: 0.878\n      hold_command_rep_drop_pp: 2.8\n      hold_diversity_drop_f1: 0.894\n      hold_diversity_drop_drop_pp: 1.2\n      hold_error_pattern_f1: 0.896\n      hold_error_pattern_drop_pp: 1.0\n      hold_tool_misuse_f1: 0.899\n      hold_tool_misuse_drop_pp: 0.7\n      sum_of_drops_pp: 9.2\n      note: \"sum > total gap (6pp vs MV) due to LF signal overlap\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      outcome_bp 贡献最大（-3.5pp）因为它提供了 trajectory outcome 的直接信号，是其他 LF 无法替代的。\n      command_repetition 次之（-2.8pp），是 stagnation 最直接的 surface indicator。\n      这两个 LF 合计贡献 6.3pp，但与 outcome-bp-sensitivity 的 holdout 结果（-4.3pp）不完全一致，\n      因为 holdout 移除的是 LF（影响标签生成），而此处是移除 LF 后重新用剩余 LFs 生成标签再训练。\n      diversity_drop、error_pattern、tool_misuse 各贡献 0.7-1.2pp，信号与前两个 LF 有 overlap。\n      边际贡献之和（9.2pp）大于整体增量说明 LFs 之间有 redundancy，这是 data programming 的典型现象。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: LF Hold-One-Out Ablation\"\n        data: |\n          | Held-out LF         | Macro-F1 | Drop (pp) | % of Total Signal |\n          |---------------------|----------|-----------|-------------------|\n          | None (Full)         | 0.906    | —         | —                 |\n          | outcome_bp          | 0.871    | -3.5      | 38%               |\n          | command_repetition  | 0.878    | -2.8      | 30%               |\n          | diversity_drop      | 0.894    | -1.2      | 13%               |\n          | error_pattern       | 0.896    | -1.0      | 11%               |\n          | tool_misuse         | 0.899    | -0.7      | 8%                |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: 各 LF 移除后的 F1 下降，按贡献从大到小排列\"\n    analysis: >\n      outcome_bp 和 command_repetition 合计占 ~68% 的 LF 信号。\n      结合 outcome-bp-sensitivity 结果，outcome_bp 是最有价值但也最有泄露风险的 LF。\n      论文应讨论 LF 设计的 trade-off：高信息量 LF 往往与 outcome 更 correlated。\n      此结果也解释了 temporal LM 增益集中在 2 个 LF pair 的原因——\n      只有信号最强的 LFs 才有足够的 effect size 让 temporal weighting 产生差异。\n\n  - name: \"SupCon Auxiliary Loss Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"有/无 contrastive loss 对 F1 和 embedding 分离度的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      no_supcon_auto_f1: 0.906\n      supcon_alpha05_auto_f1: 0.911\n      supcon_alpha10_auto_f1: 0.907\n      supcon_alpha05_gold_f1: 0.81\n      no_supcon_gold_f1: 0.80\n      supcon_embedding_silhouette: 0.52\n      no_supcon_embedding_silhouette: 0.42\n      supcon_training_time_increase_pct: 35\n    result_rationale: >\n      SupCon loss（α=0.5）在 auto F1 上仅增加 0.5pp，在 gold F1 上增加 1pp。\n      增量有限因为 GRU 的 hidden state 已经通过 classification loss 隐式学到了 class separation。\n      SupCon 的主要效果在 embedding 空间的 silhouette 分数（0.42→0.52），\n      即 GRU representation 更 clustered，但这不直接转化为 F1 增量。\n      α=1.0 时 contrastive loss 权重过大，classification loss 被稀释，F1 略降。\n      训练时间增加 35%（需计算 pairwise 距离），投入产出比不高。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: SupCon Loss Ablation\"\n        data: |\n          | Configuration    | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | Silhouette | Train Time |\n          |------------------|---------|---------|------------|------------|\n          | CE only (default)| 0.906   | 0.800   | 0.42       | 1.0×       |\n          | CE + SupCon α=0.5| 0.911   | 0.810   | 0.52       | 1.35×      |\n          | CE + SupCon α=1.0| 0.907   | 0.805   | 0.55       | 1.35×      |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE: GRU hidden states with/without SupCon，对比 cluster 分离度\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon 的增量不显著（<1pp auto, ~1pp gold），不值得作为 default configuration。\n      在 appendix 中报告，说明 \"contrastive learning provides marginal gains in embedding\n      quality but does not significantly improve classification performance\"。\n      如果 reviewer 问 \"did you try contrastive learning?\"，这个 ablation 提供了答案。\n\n  - name: \"Non-NLP Structural Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"仅用纯结构/数值特征分类，证明 NL embedding 的必要性\"\n    expected_results:\n      structural_lr_auto_f1: 0.682\n      structural_gbdt_auto_f1: 0.714\n      structural_lr_gold_f1: 0.65\n      structural_gbdt_gold_f1: 0.68\n      features_used: [\"lines_added\", \"lines_deleted\", \"file_count_changed\", \"has_test_file\", \"command_count\", \"unique_command_ratio\", \"ast_diff_size\", \"error_keyword_count\"]\n      feature_count: 8\n      vs_probe_gap_pp: 19.2\n      vs_repeat3_gap_pp: -12.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      纯结构特征能捕获一些 progress signal：有测试文件变更、代码行数增加通常意味着 progress。\n      但关键限制是 semantic stagnation——agent 可能生成大量代码变更但都是无效的（重复解法、错误方向），\n      结构特征无法区分\"有效的大量变更\"和\"无效的大量变更\"。\n      GBDT 略优于 LR（+3.2pp）因为非线性特征组合（如\"高行数变更 + 无测试文件\"= 可能是 stagnation）。\n      但两者均远低于 Repeat-3（0.84），说明 NL embedding 不仅必要而且是核心。\n      这个结果强化了 venue fit：如果纯结构特征足够，问题就不需要 NLP，只是 SE。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Non-NLP Baseline\"\n        data: |\n          | Method                | Auto Macro-F1 | Gold Macro-F1 | Features |\n          |-----------------------|---------------|---------------|----------|\n          | Structural LR         | 0.682         | 0.650         | 8 numeric|\n          | Structural GBDT       | 0.714         | 0.680         | 8 numeric|\n          | Repeat-3              | 0.843         | 0.630         | 1 rule   |\n          | Probe (NL embedding)  | 0.906         | 0.800         | 1024-dim |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      19pp gap 充分证明 NL embedding 必要性。论文中一句话即可：\n      \"Structural features alone achieve 0.71 macro-F1, 19pp below our probe,\n      confirming that progress estimation requires semantic understanding of action content.\"\n      这也回应了潜在的 \"why NLP venue?\" 质疑——只有 NL embedding 才能区分 semantic stagnation。\n\n  - name: \"Encoder Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"encoder-ablation\"\n    description: \"Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B vs BGE-M3 vs E5-large vs GTE，评估 encoder 选择敏感度\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen3_auto_f1: 0.906\n      bge_m3_auto_f1: 0.891\n      e5_large_auto_f1: 0.886\n      gte_large_auto_f1: 0.894\n      qwen3_gold_f1: 0.80\n      bge_m3_gold_f1: 0.79\n      e5_large_gold_f1: 0.78\n      gte_large_gold_f1: 0.79\n      qwen3_embed_dim: 1024\n      bge_m3_embed_dim: 1024\n      e5_large_embed_dim: 1024\n      gte_large_embed_dim: 1024\n      qwen3_embed_time_min: 53\n      bge_m3_embed_time_min: 48\n      e5_large_embed_time_min: 42\n      gte_large_embed_time_min: 45\n      max_f1_range_pp: 2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      所有 encoder 在 [0.886, 0.906] 范围内，max range 2pp，说明 probe 对 encoder 选择不过分敏感。\n      Qwen3 略优可能因为其训练数据包含更多 code/technical content（对 agent trajectory 更匹配）。\n      BGE-M3 和 GTE 表现相近，E5 略低可能因为其训练目标（retrieval-oriented）与 classification 有轻微 mismatch。\n      但差异都在 2pp 以内，说明 progress/stagnation 信号足够强，\n      多数 modern embedding model 都能捕获——方法不依赖特定 encoder。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Encoder Ablation\"\n        data: |\n          | Encoder               | Dim  | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | Embed Time | Δ vs Qwen3 |\n          |-----------------------|------|---------|---------|------------|------------|\n          | Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B  | 1024 | 0.906   | 0.800   | 53min      | —          |\n          | GTE-large             | 1024 | 0.894   | 0.790   | 45min      | -1.2pp     |\n          | BGE-M3                | 1024 | 0.891   | 0.790   | 48min      | -1.5pp     |\n          | E5-large-v2           | 1024 | 0.886   | 0.780   | 42min      | -2.0pp     |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 各 encoder 的 auto F1 和 gold F1，带 error bar（multi-seed）\"\n    analysis: >\n      2pp range 说明方法 encoder-agnostic。论文中选择 Qwen3 是 justified（best performer），\n      但应在 appendix 报告所有 encoder 结果，说明 \"our method is not critically dependent on encoder choice\"。\n      这增加 reproducibility 信心：如果 Qwen3 不可用，BGE 或 GTE 也能达到接近效果。\n\n  - name: \"Data Scaling Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"10%/25%/50%/100% 训练数据的 probe F1，评估标注数据需求\"\n    expected_results:\n      pct_10_train_windows: 1540\n      pct_10_auto_f1: 0.811\n      pct_25_train_windows: 3850\n      pct_25_auto_f1: 0.858\n      pct_50_train_windows: 7700\n      pct_50_auto_f1: 0.887\n      pct_100_train_windows: 15401\n      pct_100_auto_f1: 0.906\n      pct_10_gold_f1: 0.72\n      pct_25_gold_f1: 0.76\n      pct_50_gold_f1: 0.78\n      pct_100_gold_f1: 0.80\n      elbow_point_pct: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      典型 learning curve：10%→25% 增量 4.7pp，25%→50% 增量 2.9pp，50%→100% 增量 1.9pp。\n      Diminishing returns 从 25% 开始显现——1,540 窗口已 capture 大部分 pattern。\n      这说明 (1) progress/stagnation 信号 relatively simple（几千样本就能学到），\n      (2) 方法实用性好——不需要海量数据。\n      Gold set 上同样 pattern：10% 已达 0.72（与 MV baseline 持平），25% 达 0.76。\n      这也为 data-efficient weak supervision 提供了证据。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Data Scaling\"\n        data: |\n          | Train % | #Windows | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | Δ vs 100% |\n          |---------|----------|---------|---------|-----------|\n          | 10%     | 1,540    | 0.811   | 0.720   | -9.5pp    |\n          | 25%     | 3,850    | 0.858   | 0.760   | -4.8pp    |\n          | 50%     | 7,700    | 0.887   | 0.780   | -1.9pp    |\n          | 100%    | 15,401   | 0.906   | 0.800   | —         |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve plot: x=#training windows (log), y=macro-F1, 标注 elbow at 25%\"\n    analysis: >\n      25% elbow point 是实用性论据：只需 ~4K weakly-labeled windows 即可达到 90% 的最终性能。\n      在 appendix 报告，支持方法的 data efficiency claim。\n      结合 human-annotation 的 400 windows gold set，说明少量数据即可建立有效监督。\n\n  - name: \"Early Termination Simulation\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"在 held-out 轨迹上模拟 stagnation-triggered early stopping 的 token savings vs success tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      threshold_03_tokens_saved_pct: 42\n      threshold_03_success_rate_drop_pct: 12\n      threshold_03_false_termination_rate: 0.18\n      threshold_05_tokens_saved_pct: 28\n      threshold_05_success_rate_drop_pct: 5\n      threshold_05_false_termination_rate: 0.08\n      threshold_07_tokens_saved_pct: 15\n      threshold_07_success_rate_drop_pct: 2\n      threshold_07_false_termination_rate: 0.03\n      optimal_threshold: 0.55\n      optimal_tokens_saved_pct: 24\n      optimal_success_rate_drop_pct: 3\n      held_out_trajectories: 312\n      avg_tokens_per_trajectory: 48500\n    result_rationale: >\n      Early termination 在 probe confidence > threshold 时终止 agent 执行。\n      threshold=0.3（aggressive）：在 42% 的轨迹上节省 tokens，但 12% 的成功轨迹被错误终止——\n      probe 将 exploratory phases 误判为 stagnation 导致 false termination。\n      threshold=0.5（balanced）：28% token savings, 5% success drop——更保守但仍有实用价值。\n      threshold=0.7（conservative）：15% savings, 2% drop——几乎只终止 high-confidence stagnation。\n      Median 档下这些 tradeoff 合理但不 dramatic：token savings 中等因为 stagnation \n      往往发生在轨迹中后期（已消耗大量 tokens），early termination 的绝对节省有限。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Early Termination Tradeoff\"\n        data: |\n          | Threshold | Tokens Saved | Success Drop | False Termination Rate |\n          |-----------|-------------|-------------|----------------------|\n          | 0.3       | 42%         | 12%         | 0.18                 |\n          | 0.5       | 28%         | 5%          | 0.08                 |\n          | 0.55 (opt)| 24%         | 3%          | 0.05                 |\n          | 0.7       | 15%         | 2%          | 0.03                 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: x=success rate drop (%), y=tokens saved (%), 各 threshold 标点\"\n    analysis: >\n      Early termination 是 probe 的 downstream application，不是核心 contribution。\n      Optimal threshold（0.55）节省 24% tokens 而 success drop 仅 3%——实用但不 transformative。\n      论文在 Discussion 中简述即可，不宜过度展开。\n      这个结果也间接证明 probe 的校准性——confidence 与实际 stagnation 概率的 monotonic relationship。\n\n  - name: \"Interpretability Visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"GRU hidden states 的 t-SNE/UMAP + attention 分析（如有）\"\n    expected_results:\n      tsne_silhouette_score: 0.42\n      umap_silhouette_score: 0.51\n      tsne_cluster_overlap_pct: 28\n      progress_cluster_centroid_distance: 2.34\n      stagnation_cluster_centroid_distance: 1.87\n      boundary_region_pct: 22\n      boundary_accuracy: 0.58\n      core_region_accuracy: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 silhouette=0.42/0.51 表明中等分离——两类在 embedding 空间中有明确趋势但重叠区域显著。\n      Overlap 28% 对应 gold set 上 20% 的错误率（probe gold F1=0.80）——\n      overlap 区域就是 probe 出错的主要来源。Boundary region（22%）精度仅 0.58，接近随机，\n      说明这些窗口本身 ambiguous。Core region（非 boundary）精度 0.94，高度可靠。\n      UMAP 优于 t-SNE 因为 UMAP 更好保留 global structure。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE 散点图：GRU last hidden state，progress(蓝)/stagnation(红) 着色，标注 overlap zone\"\n      - \"UMAP 散点图：同上，展示更清晰的 global 结构\"\n      - \"Boundary vs core region accuracy 对比图\"\n    analysis: >\n      可视化主要用于 paper 的 qualitative analysis section。\n      核心 insight：probe 的 representational space 有清晰的 class structure，\n      但 boundary region 对应 progress/stagnation 定义本身的模糊性（与 annotator disagreement 重叠）。\n      建议在 appendix 放 t-SNE/UMAP，在 main text 引用 \"GRU hidden states show class-specific\n      clustering with an overlap region corresponding to inherently ambiguous windows\"。\n\n  - name: \"Human Annotation Gold Set\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400 窗口 × 3 annotators，Fleiss κ 评估，建立 gold standard\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_windows: 400\n      annotators: 3\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.68\n      pairwise_cohen_kappa: [0.65, 0.70, 0.69]\n      avg_pairwise_kappa: 0.68\n      gold_label_distribution_progress: 248\n      gold_label_distribution_stagnation: 152\n      gold_stagnation_rate: 0.38\n      clear_progress_kappa: 0.82\n      clear_stagnation_kappa: 0.78\n      ambiguous_windows_kappa: 0.45\n      ambiguous_windows_pct: 18\n      annotation_time_per_window_min: 4.5\n      total_annotation_hours: 90\n      mv_auto_label_agreement_with_gold_pct: 74\n      sampling_strategy: \"stratified by conf level and MV label\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      κ=0.68 属\"substantial agreement\"的下界，在 A6 假设范围 [0.60, 0.75] 内。\n      Progress 易标（κ=0.82）——明确的代码变更、测试通过、文件创建等。\n      Stagnation 较难（κ=0.78）但仍可接受——明确的重复、循环、报错。\n      Ambiguous windows（18%）κ=0.45——annotators 对\"探索性但可能无效的动作\"分歧严重。\n      Stagnation rate 0.38 比 auto labels 中的 0.285（15600/54809）更高，\n      因为 stratified sampling 有意 over-sample conf=1 和 stagnation candidate 窗口。\n      MV auto labels 与 gold 一致率 74%，说明 MV 标签整体偏 noisy 但方向正确。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Inter-Annotator Agreement by Category\"\n        data: |\n          | Category            | #Windows | Fleiss κ  | Agreement % |\n          |---------------------|----------|-----------|-------------|\n          | Clear Progress      | 198      | 0.82      | 91%         |\n          | Clear Stagnation    | 130      | 0.78      | 87%         |\n          | Ambiguous           | 72       | 0.45      | 62%         |\n          | Overall             | 400      | 0.68      | 82%         |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: 3 annotators 的 confusion matrix（pairwise agreement）\"\n      - \"Distribution plot: gold label confidence（3/3 agree vs 2/3 majority）按 category\"\n    analysis: >\n      κ=0.68 是 borderline——NLP 标准通常要求 κ>0.70 for \"reliable\"。\n      论文应 (1) 报告 overall 和 per-category κ，(2) 讨论 ambiguous 类的低 agreement，\n      (3) 在 Limitations 中承认 gold set quality is \"substantial but not excellent\"。\n      Ambiguous 18% 的窗口可以 (a) 排除后重新评估，或 (b) 保留但 soft-label。\n      建议报告两个版本：full gold set（κ=0.68）和 filtered gold set（排除 ambiguous，κ=0.80+）。\n      在 filtered gold set 上 probe 的 performance 会更好看。\n\n  - name: \"LF Temporal Dynamics Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"各 LF 在 stagnation onset 的时序角色分析——temporal label model 的实证基础\"\n    expected_results:\n      command_rep_median_offset_steps: -1.8\n      command_rep_offset_std: 0.9\n      command_rep_cohens_d: 0.62\n      outcome_bp_median_offset_steps: 2.1\n      outcome_bp_offset_std: 1.3\n      outcome_bp_cohens_d: 0.45\n      diversity_drop_median_offset_steps: -1.2\n      diversity_drop_offset_std: 1.1\n      diversity_drop_cohens_d: 0.31\n      error_pattern_median_offset_steps: 0.3\n      error_pattern_offset_std: 0.8\n      error_pattern_cohens_d: 0.12\n      tool_misuse_median_offset_steps: -0.2\n      tool_misuse_offset_std: 1.0\n      tool_misuse_cohens_d: 0.08\n      significant_temporal_pairs: 2\n      significant_pair_1: \"command_rep → outcome_bp (Δ=3.9 steps, p<0.001)\"\n      significant_pair_2: \"diversity_drop → outcome_bp (Δ=3.3 steps, p<0.001)\"\n      stagnation_onset_windows_analyzed: 4820\n    result_rationale: >\n      A1 假设成立：LF 时序动态存在但 effect size 中等。\n      command_repetition 是最强 leading indicator（offset=-1.8, d=0.62）——agent 开始重复命令 \n      平均比其他 LF 早 1.8 步检测到 stagnation。这符合直觉：重复是 stagnation 最早的表面信号。\n      outcome_bp 是明确的 lagging indicator（offset=+2.1, d=0.45）——它依赖最终结果回溯，\n      天然滞后于实时 LFs。offset std=1.3 较大反映轨迹长度差异。\n      diversity_drop 弱 leading（offset=-1.2, d=0.31）——embedding 多样性下降比 explicit repetition 更微妙。\n      error_pattern 和 tool_misuse 几乎 concurrent（|offset|<0.5, d<0.15），时序分化不显著。\n      只有 2 个 LF pair（cmd_rep→outcome_bp, div_drop→outcome_bp）有 significant temporal separation——\n      这解释了 temporal LM 增益集中在少数 pair 的现象。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: LF Temporal Dynamics\"\n        data: |\n          | LF                  | Median Offset | Std   | Cohen's d | Role       | Significant? |\n          |---------------------|---------------|-------|-----------|------------|--------------|\n          | command_repetition  | -1.8 steps    | 0.9   | 0.62      | Leading    | Yes          |\n          | diversity_drop      | -1.2 steps    | 1.1   | 0.31      | Weak Lead  | Marginal     |\n          | tool_misuse         | -0.2 steps    | 1.0   | 0.08      | Concurrent | No           |\n          | error_pattern       | +0.3 steps    | 0.8   | 0.12      | Concurrent | No           |\n          | outcome_bp          | +2.1 steps    | 1.3   | 0.45      | Lagging    | Yes          |\n      - caption: \"Table: Significant LF Temporal Pairs\"\n        data: |\n          | Leading LF         | Lagging LF  | Δ Steps | p-value  |\n          |--------------------|-------------|---------|----------|\n          | command_repetition | outcome_bp  | 3.9     | <0.001   |\n          | diversity_drop     | outcome_bp  | 3.3     | <0.001   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline diagram: 典型 stagnation 序列中各 LF 的 activation 时序（示意图 + 实际数据 overlay）\"\n      - \"Violin plot: 各 LF 的 offset 分布，展示 spread 和 central tendency\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 temporal label model 的核心实证基础。结果支持 temporal awareness 的合理性，\n      但 effect size 中等意味着论文不能过度宣称 temporal dynamics 的 novelty。\n      只有 2/10 possible LF pairs 有 significant temporal separation——\n      这限制了 temporal LM 的普适性 claim。\n      论文应强调 (1) temporal dynamics 的存在是 domain insight（leading/lagging indicators），\n      (2) 这证明 i.i.d. 假设在 agent trajectory 上违反，\n      (3) 但承认 effect size 中等，temporal LM 的增量来自对少数关键 LF pair 的正确处理。\n      在 contribution framing 中，temporal dynamics analysis 本身可以作为 empirical finding，\n      即使 temporal LM 的 F1 增量不 dramatic。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12725,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12725},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01ce48a8-b818-441f-8500-04c3a5304419","uuid":"9fc94940-a532-40f8-ab55-2669f629a0a9"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":731229,"duration_api_ms":732686,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Temporal label model 有效但优势有限：vs MV 稳定 +6pp，vs FlyingSquid 仅 +3pp（部分 metric 不显著）。\n  Claim 1 降级为 interpretable temporal-aware aggregation，不再强调方法论 breakthrough。\n  Probe gold F1=0.80，student-exceeds-teacher 仅 +2pp（弱效应），vs LLM CoT 略低 -2pp 但 700x cheaper。\n  Cross-agent 有退化但 probe 比 LF oracle 退化更少（-9pp vs -14pp），保持叙事。\n  outcome_bp holdout -4pp 需加 caveat。κ=0.68 borderline acceptable。\n  论文叙事重心转向 systematic weak supervision pipeline + temporal insights，而非 temporal LM 作为核心贡献。\n  补充 ablation（encoder, window size, architecture）增加 empirical depth 弥补 novelty 不足。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"Multi-seed Probe Stability\"\n    plan_id: \"probe-multiseed\"\n    description: \"3 seeds (42,123,456) 验证 GRU probe 在 conf≥2 auto-labeled test 上的统计稳定性\"\n    expected_results:\n      seed_42_macro_f1: 0.9055\n      seed_123_macro_f1: 0.9270\n      seed_456_macro_f1: 0.9230\n      mean_macro_f1: 0.9185\n      std_macro_f1: 0.011\n      all_seeds_above_070: true\n      all_seeds_gap_above_5pp_vs_repeat3: true\n      repeat3_range: \"0.62-0.84\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 conf≥2 数据标签质量高（LFs 一致），GRU 训练稳定性好。\n      seed 间 std≈1pp 是典型值——小数据集+高信噪比场景下随机初始化影响有限。\n      所有 seed 均保持 >5pp gap vs Repeat-3，说明 gap 不是单次运气。\n      seed 123/456 略高于 seed 42 属正常波动，不影响结论。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Multi-seed Probe Results (conf≥2, auto-labeled test)\"\n        data: |\n          | Seed | Macro-F1 | Accuracy | F1-Stag | F1-Prog | Gap vs Repeat-3 |\n          |------|----------|----------|---------|---------|-----------------|\n          | 42   | 0.9055   | 0.9282   | 0.8593  | 0.9518  | +6.2pp          |\n          | 123  | 0.9270   | 0.9401   | 0.8810  | 0.9730  | +8.4pp          |\n          | 456  | 0.9230   | 0.9372   | 0.8756  | 0.9704  | +8.0pp          |\n          | Mean | 0.9185   | 0.9352   | 0.8720  | 0.9651  | +7.5pp          |\n          | Std  | 0.011    | 0.006    | 0.012   | 0.011   | —               |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Box plot: 3 seeds 的 macro-F1 分布 vs Repeat-3 baseline 范围，展示 probe 稳定优于 baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      统计稳定性确认。std=1.1pp 可在论文中报告为 mean±std，增加结果可信度。\n      Repeat-3 在不同 test split 下波动更大（0.62-0.84），probe 更稳定。\n      论文可写：ProgressProbe achieves 0.919±0.011 macro-F1 across 3 seeds, consistently outperforming Repeat-3 by >5pp。\n\n  - name: \"CosineSim Baseline Diagnostic\"\n    plan_id: \"cosinesim-check\"\n    description: \"排查 CosineSim baseline F1=0.3129 是否合理：阈值、分布分析、阈值优化\"\n    expected_results:\n      default_threshold: 0.91\n      default_threshold_f1: 0.3129\n      similarity_mean: 0.913\n      similarity_std: 0.038\n      similarity_skewness: -1.42\n      optimal_threshold: 0.872\n      optimal_threshold_f1: 0.583\n      label_correlation_with_similarity: -0.18\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen3 embeddings 在 code/trajectory 数据上天然高相似度（mean=0.91, std=0.038），\n      绝大多数窗口的平均 pairwise cosine similarity 集中在 [0.85, 0.95] 区间。\n      默认阈值（median=0.91）将分布几乎对半切，但相似度与 progress/stagnation 标签的相关性极弱（r=-0.18），\n      因为高相似度既可以是 progress（连续有效动作语义相近）也可以是 stagnation（重复动作）。\n      阈值优化后 F1 提升至 0.58，但仍远低于 probe，证实单一统计量不足以捕获 progress 语义。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: CosineSim Threshold Sensitivity\"\n        data: |\n          | Threshold | Precision | Recall | Macro-F1 |\n          |-----------|-----------|--------|----------|\n          | 0.91 (median) | 0.42  | 0.38   | 0.3129   |\n          | 0.90      | 0.48      | 0.51   | 0.47     |\n          | 0.872 (opt) | 0.57   | 0.60   | 0.583    |\n          | 0.85      | 0.53      | 0.64   | 0.55     |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: 窗口级 cosine similarity 分布（progress vs stagnation 分色），展示两类高度重叠\"\n    analysis: >\n      0.3129 确认合理——不是 bug 而是 cosine similarity 作为 progress proxy 的根本局限。\n      即使优化阈值也只到 0.58，比 Repeat-3 (0.84) 低 26pp。\n      论文可将 CosineSim 保留为 baseline 但无需过多讨论，简述\"单一相似度统计量不足以区分语义相似的 progress 和 stagnation\"。\n\n  - name: \"LF Ensemble Oracle Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-lf-oracle\"\n    description: \"直接在推理时应用 LFs + 聚合做窗口判定，建立 LF 可用时的性能上界\"\n    expected_results:\n      lf_oracle_mv_auto_conf2_f1: 0.972\n      lf_oracle_mv_gold_f1: 0.72\n      lf_oracle_temporal_lm_gold_f1: 0.78\n      lf_oracle_coverage_gold: 0.94\n      lf_oracle_abstain_rate_gold: 0.06\n      probe_gold_f1: 0.80\n      probe_vs_lf_oracle_temporal_lm_gain_pp: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF oracle 在 auto-labeled conf≥2 上接近 1.0 是 tautological（标签来自同一组 LFs）。\n      在 gold set 上，LF oracle(MV) = 0.72 反映 MV 聚合质量的上限。\n      LF oracle(temporal LM) = 0.78 反映 temporal LM 聚合质量。\n      Probe 在 gold 上达 0.80，超 LF oracle 2pp——这是 student-exceeds-teacher 效应，\n      但在 median 档下仅 2pp，属\"弱效应\"。Probe 通过 embedding 学到了 LF 未捕获的 pattern，\n      但增量有限——temporal LM 的 LF 聚合本身已经相当强。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: LF Oracle vs Probe on Gold Set\"\n        data: |\n          | Method                  | Gold Macro-F1 | Gold Accuracy | Requires LFs at Inference |\n          |-------------------------|---------------|---------------|---------------------------|\n          | LF Oracle (MV)          | 0.720         | 0.740         | Yes                       |\n          | LF Oracle (Temporal LM) | 0.780         | 0.800         | Yes                       |\n          | Probe (Temporal LM)     | 0.800         | 0.821         | No                        |\n          | Probe (MV, conf≥2)      | 0.770         | 0.792         | No                        |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      Student-exceeds-teacher 效应仅 +2pp，需弱化表述：\n      \"probe matches or slightly exceeds the LF oracle without requiring LF computation at inference\"。\n      核心 selling point 不是 F1 增量而是 inference-time independence from LFs——\n      在 LFs 不可用的场景（cross-agent, missing tool output）probe 仍可工作而 LF oracle 无法运行。\n\n  - name: \"LLM-as-Judge Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"baseline-llm-judge\"\n    description: \"Claude Sonnet 3.5 + GPT-4o 在 gold set 上 zero-shot / few-shot / CoT 评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_zero_shot_gold_f1: 0.73\n      claude_few_shot_gold_f1: 0.78\n      claude_cot_gold_f1: 0.82\n      gpt4o_zero_shot_gold_f1: 0.71\n      gpt4o_few_shot_gold_f1: 0.76\n      gpt4o_cot_gold_f1: 0.80\n      probe_gold_f1: 0.80\n      probe_vs_best_llm_cot_gap_pp: -2\n      probe_latency_ms: 4\n      claude_cot_latency_ms: 3200\n      gpt4o_cot_latency_ms: 2800\n      speedup_vs_claude_cot: 800\n      speedup_vs_gpt4o_cot: 700\n      probe_cost_per_1k_usd: 0.001\n      claude_cot_cost_per_1k_usd: 0.85\n      gpt4o_cot_cost_per_1k_usd: 0.62\n      api_total_cost_usd: 112\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 LLM CoT macro-F1=0.80-0.82，probe=0.80，probe 略低于 best LLM CoT 2pp。\n      LLM 的 \"progress\" 概念理解能力强（尤其 CoT 版本），但在 domain-specific 细节（specific tool usage patterns, \n      SE workflow conventions）上不如 LF-trained probe 精准。Zero-shot 效果较差因为 progress/stagnation \n      在 agent trajectory 上下文中定义模糊；few-shot 提供了校准示例；CoT 允许 LLM 分析多步推理链。\n      Claude 略优于 GPT-4o 因为 longer context handling。\n      Probe vs LLM gap 仅 -2pp，但 cost/speed 优势是 700-800x——这是 Pareto 前沿论据的核心。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: LLM-as-Judge vs Probe on Gold Set\"\n        data: |\n          | Method              | Macro-F1 | F1-Stag | F1-Prog | Latency/window | Cost/$1K |\n          |---------------------|----------|---------|---------|----------------|----------|\n          | Claude Zero-shot    | 0.730    | 0.658   | 0.802   | 3.2s           | $0.52    |\n          | Claude Few-shot     | 0.780    | 0.721   | 0.839   | 3.5s           | $0.68    |\n          | Claude CoT          | 0.820    | 0.775   | 0.865   | 4.1s           | $0.85    |\n          | GPT-4o Zero-shot    | 0.710    | 0.632   | 0.788   | 2.8s           | $0.38    |\n          | GPT-4o Few-shot     | 0.760    | 0.698   | 0.822   | 3.0s           | $0.48    |\n          | GPT-4o CoT          | 0.800    | 0.751   | 0.849   | 3.4s           | $0.62    |\n          | Probe (Temporal LM) | 0.800    | 0.750   | 0.850   | 4ms            | $0.001   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cost-Accuracy Pareto 图：x=cost per 1K windows (log), y=gold macro-F1。Probe 在 Pareto 前沿左下角\"\n    analysis: >\n      Probe vs LLM CoT gap = -2pp 意味着 student-exceeds-teacher 不适用于 LLM 比较。\n      论文叙事需要调整：不再说 probe 在 accuracy 上超越所有方法，而是强调 cost-accuracy Pareto 优势。\n      \"Probe achieves comparable accuracy to LLM-as-Judge (CoT) at 700× lower latency and 800× lower cost,\n      making it suitable for real-time monitoring of agent trajectories.\"\n      CoT 版本的存在意味着 reviewer 不能说 \"LLM 被低估了\"——我们已经测了最强 LLM variant。\n\n  - name: \"Probe Error Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"error-analysis\"\n    description: \"Probe FP/FN 按 action type、LF source、trajectory outcome 分类\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_gold_test_windows: 120\n      fp_count: 16\n      fn_count: 12\n      fp_rate: 0.133\n      fn_rate: 0.100\n      fp_exploration_misclassified_pct: 42\n      fp_early_trajectory_pct: 25\n      fp_tool_setup_pct: 18\n      fp_other_pct: 15\n      fn_semantic_diverse_stagnation_pct: 55\n      fn_gradual_degradation_pct: 28\n      fn_outcome_dependent_pct: 17\n      error_overlap_with_human_disagreement_pct: 63\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 probe gold F1=0.80，意味着约 20% 的窗口被错误分类。\n      FP 主要是\"探索性动作被误判为 stagnation\"——agent 尝试新方向时表面上看似无 progress，\n      但实际上是有目的的搜索行为。这与 stagnation 在 embedding 空间中的表征高度重叠。\n      FN 主要是\"语义多样化的 stagnation\"——agent 执行不同但同样无效的动作，表面多样性骗过了 probe。\n      63% 的 probe 错误与人工标注者的 disagreement 区域重叠，说明这些本身是 hard cases。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Error Taxonomy\"\n        data: |\n          | Error Type | Count | % of Errors | Dominant Pattern                                 |\n          |------------|-------|-------------|--------------------------------------------------|\n          | FP         | 16    | 57%         | Exploration misclassified (42%), early traj (25%) |\n          | FN         | 12    | 43%         | Semantic diverse stagnation (55%), gradual (28%)  |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Confusion matrix heatmap on gold set (progress/stagnation × predicted/actual)\"\n      - \"FP/FN 示例：每类 2-3 个典型 trajectory window 片段，标注 probe 预测 vs human label vs LF outputs\"\n    analysis: >\n      错误分析支持 probe 的定位：它在\"明确\"场景下有效，在\"模糊\"场景下与人类标注者面临相同困难。\n      63% 的错误与 annotator disagreement 重叠，意味着这些不是 probe 的 systematic failure，\n      而是 task 本身的模糊性。论文可加一节讨论 progress estimation 的 inherent ambiguity，\n      将部分错误归因于 label definition 而非 model failure。\n      FN 中 55% 的 semantic diverse stagnation 是方法的主要 limitation——论文需在 Limitations 中承认。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Agent Transfer Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"cross-agent\"\n    description: \"SWE-agent 训练的 probe 在 OpenHands 轨迹上的 zero-shot 迁移评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      openhands_total_trajectories: 1247\n      openhands_total_windows: 18340\n      openhands_embedded_windows: 16892\n      cross_agent_probe_macro_f1: 0.71\n      cross_agent_probe_accuracy: 0.74\n      cross_agent_probe_f1_stagnation: 0.64\n      cross_agent_probe_f1_progress: 0.78\n      cross_agent_lf_oracle_macro_f1: 0.64\n      cross_agent_lf_oracle_f1_stagnation: 0.52\n      cross_agent_lf_oracle_f1_progress: 0.76\n      in_domain_probe_gold_f1: 0.80\n      probe_degradation_pp: 9\n      lf_oracle_degradation_pp: 14\n      lf_adaptation_success_rate: 0.72\n      lf_command_rep_transfer: \"partial — OpenHands uses different shell patterns\"\n      lf_outcome_bp_transfer: \"poor — exit context format differs significantly\"\n      lf_diversity_drop_transfer: \"good — embedding-based, implementation-agnostic\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 cross-agent probe F1=0.71（范围 0.65-0.75），有退化但仍 positive。\n      Probe 退化 9pp 主要因为：(1) SWE-agent 和 OpenHands 的 action space 不同（shell commands vs API calls），\n      embedding 分布有 shift；(2) progress/stagnation 在不同 agent 框架下表现形式不同。\n      LF oracle 退化 14pp 更严重，因为 LFs 是基于 SWE-agent 特定模式设计的（如 command_repetition \n      依赖特定 shell command 格式），在 OpenHands 上 coverage 和 precision 均下降。\n      Probe 学到了更抽象的 progress signal（通过 embedding），比 rule-based LF 更 robust to implementation差异。\n      但退化仍然显著（-9pp），需要在 Limitations 中承认 cross-agent transfer 的局限性。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Cross-Agent Transfer Results\"\n        data: |\n          | Method            | In-domain (Gold) | Cross-agent (OpenHands) | Degradation |\n          |-------------------|------------------|-------------------------|-------------|\n          | LF Oracle (MV)    | 0.720            | 0.640                   | -8.0pp      |\n          | LF Oracle (TempLM)| 0.780            | 0.640                   | -14.0pp     |\n          | Probe (TempLM)    | 0.800            | 0.710                   | -9.0pp      |\n          | Repeat-3          | 0.630            | 0.580                   | -5.0pp      |\n      - caption: \"Table: Per-LF Transfer Success\"\n        data: |\n          | LF                   | In-domain Prec | Cross-agent Prec | Transfer Quality |\n          |----------------------|----------------|------------------|------------------|\n          | command_repetition   | 0.85           | 0.62             | Partial          |\n          | outcome_bp           | 0.78           | 0.41             | Poor             |\n          | diversity_drop       | 0.81           | 0.74             | Good             |\n          | error_pattern        | 0.76           | 0.58             | Partial          |\n          | tool_misuse          | 0.72           | 0.39             | Poor             |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 各方法 in-domain vs cross-agent F1 对比，突出 probe 退化小于 LF oracle\"\n      - \"t-SNE: SWE-agent vs OpenHands embedding 分布，展示 domain shift 但共享结构\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-agent 结果支持 Claim 3 但需加 degradation caveat。\n      Probe 迁移优于 LF oracle（-9pp vs -14pp）是核心论据——probe 学到的 embedding-based signal \n      比 rule-based LF 更 implementation-agnostic。\n      但 0.71 的绝对 F1 偏低，不能过度宣称 \"generalizable progress estimation\"。\n      论文应写：\"probe maintains positive transfer (F1=0.71) while LF oracle degrades substantially,\n      suggesting the probe captures implementation-agnostic progress signals, though further\n      adaptation may be needed for robust cross-implementation deployment.\"\n\n  - name: \"Temporal Label Model\"\n    plan_id: \"temporal-label-model\"\n    description: \"利用 LF 时序角色（leading/lagging/concurrent）进行时序感知标签聚合，替代 naive MV\"\n    expected_results:\n      implementation: \"temporal-weighted voting with offset-adjusted LF weights\"\n      temporal_lm_gold_label_macro_f1: 0.78\n      temporal_lm_gold_label_accuracy: 0.80\n      mv_gold_label_macro_f1: 0.72\n      mv_gold_label_accuracy: 0.74\n      gain_vs_mv_pp: 6\n      gain_vs_flyingsquid_pp: 3\n      temporal_lm_conf1_accuracy: 0.73\n      mv_conf1_accuracy: 0.62\n      temporal_lm_conf2_accuracy: 0.91\n      mv_conf2_accuracy: 0.89\n      label_change_rate_overall: 0.22\n      label_change_rate_conf1: 0.30\n      label_change_rate_conf2: 0.05\n      probe_retrained_temporal_lm_gold_f1: 0.80\n      probe_retrained_temporal_lm_auto_f1: 0.882\n      temporal_lm_interpretable_roles: 5\n      dominant_lf_pairs_for_gain: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 temporal LM vs MV gain = +6pp（范围 4-8pp），来源集中在 conf=1 窗口。\n      在 conf=1 窗口中，LFs 分歧，MV 本质是 coin flip。Temporal LM 利用时序角色打破平局：\n      leading LF（如 command_repetition，offset=-1.8 步）在早期 fire 更可信，\n      lagging LF（如 outcome_bp，offset=+2.1 步）在晚期 fire 更可信。\n      但 A1 假设成立：effect size 中等，增益主要来自 command_rep-outcome_bp 和 diversity_drop-outcome_bp \n      两个 LF 对。其余 LF 对的时序分化不明显，temporal weighting 对它们几乎无影响。\n      vs FlyingSquid 仅 +3pp 因为 FlyingSquid 已经通过 correlation modeling 部分解决了 LF 依赖问题，\n      temporal LM 的额外增量来自 temporal ordering（FlyingSquid 不建模时序）。\n      conf≥2 窗口上两者差异极小（<2pp），因为 LF 一致时时序权重不改变多数投票结果。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Label Quality Comparison on Gold Set (400 windows)\"\n        data: |\n          | Label Model     | Gold Macro-F1 | Gold Acc | Conf=1 Acc | Conf≥2 Acc | Label Changes |\n          |-----------------|---------------|----------|------------|------------|---------------|\n          | Majority Vote   | 0.720         | 0.740    | 0.620      | 0.890      | —             |\n          | FlyingSquid     | 0.750         | 0.770    | 0.670      | 0.895      | 18%           |\n          | Temporal LM     | 0.780         | 0.800    | 0.730      | 0.910      | 22%           |\n      - caption: \"Table: Temporal LM Ablation — Contribution of Temporal Weighting by LF Pair\"\n        data: |\n          | Ablation                          | Gold Macro-F1 | Δ vs Full Temporal LM |\n          |-----------------------------------|---------------|-----------------------|\n          | Full Temporal LM                  | 0.780         | —                     |\n          | Remove cmd_rep–outcome_bp offset  | 0.755         | -2.5pp                |\n          | Remove div_drop–outcome_bp offset | 0.768         | -1.2pp                |\n          | Remove all other offsets           | 0.776         | -0.4pp                |\n          | Uniform weights (= MV)            | 0.720         | -6.0pp                |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: LF pair 时序 offset 矩阵，颜色编码 temporal separation 强度\"\n      - \"Bar chart: 各 label model 在 gold set 上 per-class F1 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      Temporal LM +6pp vs MV 是一个 solid 但不 spectacular 的结果。\n      关键洞察：增益集中在 2 个 LF pair，其余 LF 的时序分化不显著。\n      这意味着 Claim 1 不能宣称 \"general temporal label model methodology\"，\n      而应定位为 \"temporal-aware aggregation that exploits domain-specific leading/lagging indicators\"。\n      vs FlyingSquid 仅 +3pp 且在部分 metric（如 per-class recall on progress）可能不显著——\n      需报告 confidence interval 或 bootstrap test。\n      优势在可解释性：每个 LF 的 temporal role 可 inspect（leading/lagging），\n      而 FlyingSquid 的 LF dependency structure 是 latent 的。\n      论文应在 Discussion 中强调 interpretability + no i.i.d. assumption 作为 temporal LM 的核心价值，\n      而非绝对 F1 增量。\n\n  - name: \"FlyingSquid Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"flyingsquid-baseline\"\n    description: \"FlyingSquid 相关性感知 label model 作为 baseline，直接回应 reviewer concern\"\n    expected_results:\n      flyingsquid_gold_label_macro_f1: 0.75\n      flyingsquid_gold_label_accuracy: 0.77\n      flyingsquid_vs_mv_gain_pp: 3\n      flyingsquid_vs_temporal_lm_gap_pp: -3\n      flyingsquid_auto_label_accuracy: 0.88\n      flyingsquid_training_time_sec: 45\n      flyingsquid_lf_dependency_edges: 4\n      probe_on_flyingsquid_labels_gold_f1: 0.78\n      probe_on_flyingsquid_labels_auto_f1: 0.874\n    result_rationale: >\n      FlyingSquid 通过 triplet method 建模 LF pairwise 依赖，不需要 i.i.d. 假设。\n      在 agent trajectory 数据上，FlyingSquid 能发现 4 条 LF 依赖边（如 command_rep ↔ diversity_drop），\n      从而比 MV 更好地处理 correlated LFs。Gold F1=0.75，比 MV +3pp。\n      但 FlyingSquid 不建模时序结构——它把所有窗口视为 i.i.d. 样本，忽略 trajectory 内的顺序。\n      因此 vs Temporal LM 差 3pp：temporal LM 利用时序 offset 在 conf=1 窗口上做出更精准的聚合。\n      FlyingSquid 的优势是成熟的统计框架和理论保证；劣势是 temporal blindness。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: FlyingSquid vs Other Label Models\"\n        data: |\n          | Label Model     | Gold Macro-F1 | vs MV    | Training Time | Interpretability |\n          |-----------------|---------------|----------|---------------|------------------|\n          | Majority Vote   | 0.720         | —        | 0s            | High (trivial)   |\n          | FlyingSquid     | 0.750         | +3.0pp   | 45s           | Low (latent)     |\n          | Temporal LM     | 0.780         | +6.0pp   | 120s          | High (explicit)  |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"FlyingSquid 推断的 LF dependency graph 可视化\"\n    analysis: >\n      FlyingSquid 是 strong baseline——它已经比 MV 好 3pp，且有理论保证。\n      Temporal LM vs FlyingSquid 的 3pp 增量需要谨慎 claim：\n      如果 bootstrap 95% CI 包含 0，则只能说 \"comparable with interpretability advantage\"。\n      论文策略：即使 F1 差异 marginal，temporal LM 的优势在于 (1) 可解释的 temporal roles\n      (2) 不需要估计 LF accuracy（FlyingSquid 需要）(3) 对 sequential data 的 structural match。\n\n  - name: \"Outcome BP Sensitivity Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"outcome-bp-sensitivity\"\n    description: \"outcome_backpropagation 信息泄露量化：holdout + last-N variant\"\n    expected_results:\n      exit_context_trajectory_pct: 34\n      outcome_bp_window_pct: 28\n      outcome_bp_fires_in_last_3_windows_pct: 71\n      holdout_probe_auto_f1: 0.862\n      holdout_probe_auto_f1_drop_pp: 4.3\n      holdout_probe_gold_f1: 0.76\n      holdout_probe_gold_f1_drop_pp: 4\n      last_3_only_probe_auto_f1: 0.886\n      last_3_only_probe_auto_f1_drop_pp: 2.0\n      last_3_only_probe_gold_f1: 0.78\n      last_3_only_probe_gold_f1_drop_pp: 2\n      temporal_lm_without_outcome_bp_gold_f1: 0.74\n      temporal_lm_without_outcome_bp_gain_vs_mv_pp: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      outcome_bp 利用任务最终结果（exit code/error message）回溯标注前序窗口。\n      34% 的轨迹有 exit context，outcome_bp 在 28% 的窗口上 fire。\n      完全 holdout outcome_bp 后 F1 下降 4pp（范围 3-5pp），说明这个 LF 贡献了实质信号但也有泄露成分：\n      它本质上是用事后信息（outcome）来标注事前窗口，在 offline analysis 中合理但在 real-time monitoring 中不可用。\n      Last-3-windows variant 限制 outcome_bp 仅在最后 3 个窗口 fire（71% 的 outcome_bp 原本就在此区间），\n      F1 只降 2pp——说明大部分 outcome_bp 信号本就集中在轨迹末尾，限制范围后泄露减少但信号保留。\n      Temporal LM 在没有 outcome_bp 时增益降至 +2pp vs MV（从 +6pp），\n      证实 temporal LM 的增量有一半依赖 outcome_bp 的 temporal role。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Outcome BP Sensitivity\"\n        data: |\n          | Configuration             | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | Δ vs Full |\n          |---------------------------|---------|---------|-----------|\n          | Full (all LFs)            | 0.906   | 0.800   | —         |\n          | Hold-out outcome_bp       | 0.862   | 0.760   | -4.0pp    |\n          | outcome_bp last-3 only    | 0.886   | 0.780   | -2.0pp    |\n          | Temporal LM w/o outcome_bp| —       | 0.740*  | -4.0pp*   |\n        note: \"* = label quality metric, not probe prediction\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: outcome_bp firing position 在轨迹中的分布（last-1/2/3/4+ windows）\"\n    analysis: >\n      4pp drop 属\"可控但需讨论\"（A5 假设）。论文策略：\n      1. 报告 full 和 holdout 两个版本的结果\n      2. 推荐 last-3-only variant 作为实际部署配置（-2pp 但消除大部分泄露）\n      3. 在 Discussion 中讨论 outcome_bp 的 trade-off：offline training 中使用是 justified（类似 hindsight experience replay），\n         但部署时需要 caveat。\n      Temporal LM 增益对 outcome_bp 的依赖（+6pp → +2pp）是需要坦诚报告的弱点——\n      说明 temporal label model 的一半价值来自一个有泄露嫌疑的 LF。\n\n  - name: \"Window Size Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-window-size\"\n    description: \"Window size k=3,5,7 对检测粒度与信号积累的 tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      k3_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.872\n      k3_gold_macro_f1: 0.76\n      k5_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.906\n      k5_gold_macro_f1: 0.80\n      k7_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.893\n      k7_gold_macro_f1: 0.79\n      k3_avg_steps_per_window: 3.0\n      k5_avg_steps_per_window: 5.0\n      k7_avg_steps_per_window: 7.0\n      k3_total_windows: 91348\n      k5_total_windows: 54809\n      k7_total_windows: 39149\n    result_rationale: >\n      k=3 太短：stagnation 通常需要 4+ 步才能建立模式，3 步窗口内 progress 和 stagnation 的区分度不足，\n      且 temporal LM 的 offset（1.2-2.1 步）无法在 3 步窗口内充分展开。F1 下降 3.4pp。\n      k=5 是 sweet spot：足够捕获 multi-step stagnation pattern，同时不引入过多无关步骤。\n      k=7 略微退化（-1.3pp）：窗口过长导致 (1) progress 和 stagnation 信号稀释（一个窗口可能包含两者），\n      (2) 窗口数量减少 29% 导致训练数据有效减少。但退化幅度小，说明 probe 对窗口大小不过分敏感。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Window Size Ablation\"\n        data: |\n          | k | Auto Macro-F1 | Gold Macro-F1 | #Windows | Δ vs k=5 |\n          |---|---------------|---------------|----------|----------|\n          | 3 | 0.872         | 0.760         | 91,348   | -3.4pp   |\n          | 5 | 0.906         | 0.800         | 54,809   | —        |\n          | 7 | 0.893         | 0.790         | 39,149   | -1.3pp   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: window size vs macro-F1（auto + gold 两条线），展示 k=5 为 optimal\"\n    analysis: >\n      k=5 最优但 k=7 也接近——论文可报告 k=5 作为默认并说明对 k 的敏感度适中。\n      k=3 的显著退化 supports temporal modeling 需要足够窗口长度的论点。\n      补充 empirical depth，增加 reviewers 对方法 robustness 的信心。\n\n  - name: \"Architecture Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-architecture\"\n    description: \"GRU vs GRU+attention vs Transformer encoder vs MLP on pooled features\"\n    expected_results:\n      gru_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.906\n      gru_attention_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.912\n      transformer_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.883\n      mlp_meanpool_auto_conf2_macro_f1: 0.857\n      gru_params: 542210\n      gru_attention_params: 608514\n      transformer_params: 1247234\n      mlp_meanpool_params: 263170\n      gru_gold_f1: 0.80\n      gru_attention_gold_f1: 0.81\n      transformer_gold_f1: 0.78\n      mlp_meanpool_gold_f1: 0.76\n    result_rationale: >\n      GRU 是 sequential modeling 的自然选择，在 ~15K 训练样本上足够且不 overfit。\n      GRU+attention 增加 ~0.6pp：attention 允许模型关注 stagnation onset 的关键步骤，但增量有限\n      因为 GRU 的 hidden state 已经隐式 aggregate 了时序信息。\n      Transformer 退化 -2.3pp：自注意力在 5 步序列上参数过多（1.2M vs GRU 0.5M），\n      训练数据不足以利用其表达能力，轻微 overfit（val-test gap 增大）。\n      MLP on mean-pool 退化 -4.9pp：与 baseline-meanpool-lr 结论一致，丢失时序信息。\n      GRU vs MLP 的 gap（4.9pp）直接证明序列建模的增量价值。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Architecture Ablation\"\n        data: |\n          | Architecture       | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | #Params  | Δ vs GRU |\n          |--------------------|---------|---------|----------|----------|\n          | MLP (mean-pool)    | 0.857   | 0.760   | 263K     | -4.9pp   |\n          | Transformer        | 0.883   | 0.780   | 1,247K   | -2.3pp   |\n          | GRU (default)      | 0.906   | 0.800   | 542K     | —        |\n          | GRU + Attention    | 0.912   | 0.810   | 609K     | +0.6pp   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: #params vs macro-F1，展示 GRU 在 efficiency-performance tradeoff 上最优\"\n    analysis: >\n      GRU 是 justified choice——不是最复杂但最适合数据规模和序列长度。\n      GRU+attention 的微小增量（0.6pp）不值得增加架构复杂度，论文可在 appendix 报告。\n      Transformer 退化证实\"big model ≠ better\"在 small-data regime 下的规律。\n      MLP 退化直接支持 \"temporal modeling matters\" 的 claim。\n      论文应写：\"We select a 2-layer GRU as the best tradeoff between model capacity\n      and data efficiency; adding attention yields marginal gains while Transformer overfits.\"\n\n  - name: \"LF Hold-One-Out Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-lf-holdout\"\n    description: \"每次移除一个 LF 重新训练，量化各 LF 边际贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      full_lf_auto_f1: 0.906\n      hold_outcome_bp_f1: 0.871\n      hold_outcome_bp_drop_pp: 3.5\n      hold_command_rep_f1: 0.878\n      hold_command_rep_drop_pp: 2.8\n      hold_diversity_drop_f1: 0.894\n      hold_diversity_drop_drop_pp: 1.2\n      hold_error_pattern_f1: 0.896\n      hold_error_pattern_drop_pp: 1.0\n      hold_tool_misuse_f1: 0.899\n      hold_tool_misuse_drop_pp: 0.7\n      sum_of_drops_pp: 9.2\n      note: \"sum > total gap (6pp vs MV) due to LF signal overlap\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      outcome_bp 贡献最大（-3.5pp）因为它提供了 trajectory outcome 的直接信号，是其他 LF 无法替代的。\n      command_repetition 次之（-2.8pp），是 stagnation 最直接的 surface indicator。\n      这两个 LF 合计贡献 6.3pp，但与 outcome-bp-sensitivity 的 holdout 结果（-4.3pp）不完全一致，\n      因为 holdout 移除的是 LF（影响标签生成），而此处是移除 LF 后重新用剩余 LFs 生成标签再训练。\n      diversity_drop、error_pattern、tool_misuse 各贡献 0.7-1.2pp，信号与前两个 LF 有 overlap。\n      边际贡献之和（9.2pp）大于整体增量说明 LFs 之间有 redundancy，这是 data programming 的典型现象。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: LF Hold-One-Out Ablation\"\n        data: |\n          | Held-out LF         | Macro-F1 | Drop (pp) | % of Total Signal |\n          |---------------------|----------|-----------|-------------------|\n          | None (Full)         | 0.906    | —         | —                 |\n          | outcome_bp          | 0.871    | -3.5      | 38%               |\n          | command_repetition  | 0.878    | -2.8      | 30%               |\n          | diversity_drop      | 0.894    | -1.2      | 13%               |\n          | error_pattern       | 0.896    | -1.0      | 11%               |\n          | tool_misuse         | 0.899    | -0.7      | 8%                |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: 各 LF 移除后的 F1 下降，按贡献从大到小排列\"\n    analysis: >\n      outcome_bp 和 command_repetition 合计占 ~68% 的 LF 信号。\n      结合 outcome-bp-sensitivity 结果，outcome_bp 是最有价值但也最有泄露风险的 LF。\n      论文应讨论 LF 设计的 trade-off：高信息量 LF 往往与 outcome 更 correlated。\n      此结果也解释了 temporal LM 增益集中在 2 个 LF pair 的原因——\n      只有信号最强的 LFs 才有足够的 effect size 让 temporal weighting 产生差异。\n\n  - name: \"SupCon Auxiliary Loss Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"ablation-supcon\"\n    description: \"有/无 contrastive loss 对 F1 和 embedding 分离度的影响\"\n    expected_results:\n      no_supcon_auto_f1: 0.906\n      supcon_alpha05_auto_f1: 0.911\n      supcon_alpha10_auto_f1: 0.907\n      supcon_alpha05_gold_f1: 0.81\n      no_supcon_gold_f1: 0.80\n      supcon_embedding_silhouette: 0.52\n      no_supcon_embedding_silhouette: 0.42\n      supcon_training_time_increase_pct: 35\n    result_rationale: >\n      SupCon loss（α=0.5）在 auto F1 上仅增加 0.5pp，在 gold F1 上增加 1pp。\n      增量有限因为 GRU 的 hidden state 已经通过 classification loss 隐式学到了 class separation。\n      SupCon 的主要效果在 embedding 空间的 silhouette 分数（0.42→0.52），\n      即 GRU representation 更 clustered，但这不直接转化为 F1 增量。\n      α=1.0 时 contrastive loss 权重过大，classification loss 被稀释，F1 略降。\n      训练时间增加 35%（需计算 pairwise 距离），投入产出比不高。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: SupCon Loss Ablation\"\n        data: |\n          | Configuration    | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | Silhouette | Train Time |\n          |------------------|---------|---------|------------|------------|\n          | CE only (default)| 0.906   | 0.800   | 0.42       | 1.0×       |\n          | CE + SupCon α=0.5| 0.911   | 0.810   | 0.52       | 1.35×      |\n          | CE + SupCon α=1.0| 0.907   | 0.805   | 0.55       | 1.35×      |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE: GRU hidden states with/without SupCon，对比 cluster 分离度\"\n    analysis: >\n      SupCon 的增量不显著（<1pp auto, ~1pp gold），不值得作为 default configuration。\n      在 appendix 中报告，说明 \"contrastive learning provides marginal gains in embedding\n      quality but does not significantly improve classification performance\"。\n      如果 reviewer 问 \"did you try contrastive learning?\"，这个 ablation 提供了答案。\n\n  - name: \"Non-NLP Structural Baseline\"\n    plan_id: \"non-nlp-baseline\"\n    description: \"仅用纯结构/数值特征分类，证明 NL embedding 的必要性\"\n    expected_results:\n      structural_lr_auto_f1: 0.682\n      structural_gbdt_auto_f1: 0.714\n      structural_lr_gold_f1: 0.65\n      structural_gbdt_gold_f1: 0.68\n      features_used: [\"lines_added\", \"lines_deleted\", \"file_count_changed\", \"has_test_file\", \"command_count\", \"unique_command_ratio\", \"ast_diff_size\", \"error_keyword_count\"]\n      feature_count: 8\n      vs_probe_gap_pp: 19.2\n      vs_repeat3_gap_pp: -12.9\n    result_rationale: >\n      纯结构特征能捕获一些 progress signal：有测试文件变更、代码行数增加通常意味着 progress。\n      但关键限制是 semantic stagnation——agent 可能生成大量代码变更但都是无效的（重复解法、错误方向），\n      结构特征无法区分\"有效的大量变更\"和\"无效的大量变更\"。\n      GBDT 略优于 LR（+3.2pp）因为非线性特征组合（如\"高行数变更 + 无测试文件\"= 可能是 stagnation）。\n      但两者均远低于 Repeat-3（0.84），说明 NL embedding 不仅必要而且是核心。\n      这个结果强化了 venue fit：如果纯结构特征足够，问题就不需要 NLP，只是 SE。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Non-NLP Baseline\"\n        data: |\n          | Method                | Auto Macro-F1 | Gold Macro-F1 | Features |\n          |-----------------------|---------------|---------------|----------|\n          | Structural LR         | 0.682         | 0.650         | 8 numeric|\n          | Structural GBDT       | 0.714         | 0.680         | 8 numeric|\n          | Repeat-3              | 0.843         | 0.630         | 1 rule   |\n          | Probe (NL embedding)  | 0.906         | 0.800         | 1024-dim |\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      19pp gap 充分证明 NL embedding 必要性。论文中一句话即可：\n      \"Structural features alone achieve 0.71 macro-F1, 19pp below our probe,\n      confirming that progress estimation requires semantic understanding of action content.\"\n      这也回应了潜在的 \"why NLP venue?\" 质疑——只有 NL embedding 才能区分 semantic stagnation。\n\n  - name: \"Encoder Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"encoder-ablation\"\n    description: \"Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B vs BGE-M3 vs E5-large vs GTE，评估 encoder 选择敏感度\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen3_auto_f1: 0.906\n      bge_m3_auto_f1: 0.891\n      e5_large_auto_f1: 0.886\n      gte_large_auto_f1: 0.894\n      qwen3_gold_f1: 0.80\n      bge_m3_gold_f1: 0.79\n      e5_large_gold_f1: 0.78\n      gte_large_gold_f1: 0.79\n      qwen3_embed_dim: 1024\n      bge_m3_embed_dim: 1024\n      e5_large_embed_dim: 1024\n      gte_large_embed_dim: 1024\n      qwen3_embed_time_min: 53\n      bge_m3_embed_time_min: 48\n      e5_large_embed_time_min: 42\n      gte_large_embed_time_min: 45\n      max_f1_range_pp: 2.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      所有 encoder 在 [0.886, 0.906] 范围内，max range 2pp，说明 probe 对 encoder 选择不过分敏感。\n      Qwen3 略优可能因为其训练数据包含更多 code/technical content（对 agent trajectory 更匹配）。\n      BGE-M3 和 GTE 表现相近，E5 略低可能因为其训练目标（retrieval-oriented）与 classification 有轻微 mismatch。\n      但差异都在 2pp 以内，说明 progress/stagnation 信号足够强，\n      多数 modern embedding model 都能捕获——方法不依赖特定 encoder。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Encoder Ablation\"\n        data: |\n          | Encoder               | Dim  | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | Embed Time | Δ vs Qwen3 |\n          |-----------------------|------|---------|---------|------------|------------|\n          | Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B  | 1024 | 0.906   | 0.800   | 53min      | —          |\n          | GTE-large             | 1024 | 0.894   | 0.790   | 45min      | -1.2pp     |\n          | BGE-M3                | 1024 | 0.891   | 0.790   | 48min      | -1.5pp     |\n          | E5-large-v2           | 1024 | 0.886   | 0.780   | 42min      | -2.0pp     |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: 各 encoder 的 auto F1 和 gold F1，带 error bar（multi-seed）\"\n    analysis: >\n      2pp range 说明方法 encoder-agnostic。论文中选择 Qwen3 是 justified（best performer），\n      但应在 appendix 报告所有 encoder 结果，说明 \"our method is not critically dependent on encoder choice\"。\n      这增加 reproducibility 信心：如果 Qwen3 不可用，BGE 或 GTE 也能达到接近效果。\n\n  - name: \"Data Scaling Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"data-scaling\"\n    description: \"10%/25%/50%/100% 训练数据的 probe F1，评估标注数据需求\"\n    expected_results:\n      pct_10_train_windows: 1540\n      pct_10_auto_f1: 0.811\n      pct_25_train_windows: 3850\n      pct_25_auto_f1: 0.858\n      pct_50_train_windows: 7700\n      pct_50_auto_f1: 0.887\n      pct_100_train_windows: 15401\n      pct_100_auto_f1: 0.906\n      pct_10_gold_f1: 0.72\n      pct_25_gold_f1: 0.76\n      pct_50_gold_f1: 0.78\n      pct_100_gold_f1: 0.80\n      elbow_point_pct: 25\n    result_rationale: >\n      典型 learning curve：10%→25% 增量 4.7pp，25%→50% 增量 2.9pp，50%→100% 增量 1.9pp。\n      Diminishing returns 从 25% 开始显现——1,540 窗口已 capture 大部分 pattern。\n      这说明 (1) progress/stagnation 信号 relatively simple（几千样本就能学到），\n      (2) 方法实用性好——不需要海量数据。\n      Gold set 上同样 pattern：10% 已达 0.72（与 MV baseline 持平），25% 达 0.76。\n      这也为 data-efficient weak supervision 提供了证据。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Data Scaling\"\n        data: |\n          | Train % | #Windows | Auto F1 | Gold F1 | Δ vs 100% |\n          |---------|----------|---------|---------|-----------|\n          | 10%     | 1,540    | 0.811   | 0.720   | -9.5pp    |\n          | 25%     | 3,850    | 0.858   | 0.760   | -4.8pp    |\n          | 50%     | 7,700    | 0.887   | 0.780   | -1.9pp    |\n          | 100%    | 15,401   | 0.906   | 0.800   | —         |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Learning curve plot: x=#training windows (log), y=macro-F1, 标注 elbow at 25%\"\n    analysis: >\n      25% elbow point 是实用性论据：只需 ~4K weakly-labeled windows 即可达到 90% 的最终性能。\n      在 appendix 报告，支持方法的 data efficiency claim。\n      结合 human-annotation 的 400 windows gold set，说明少量数据即可建立有效监督。\n\n  - name: \"Early Termination Simulation\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-sim\"\n    description: \"在 held-out 轨迹上模拟 stagnation-triggered early stopping 的 token savings vs success tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      threshold_03_tokens_saved_pct: 42\n      threshold_03_success_rate_drop_pct: 12\n      threshold_03_false_termination_rate: 0.18\n      threshold_05_tokens_saved_pct: 28\n      threshold_05_success_rate_drop_pct: 5\n      threshold_05_false_termination_rate: 0.08\n      threshold_07_tokens_saved_pct: 15\n      threshold_07_success_rate_drop_pct: 2\n      threshold_07_false_termination_rate: 0.03\n      optimal_threshold: 0.55\n      optimal_tokens_saved_pct: 24\n      optimal_success_rate_drop_pct: 3\n      held_out_trajectories: 312\n      avg_tokens_per_trajectory: 48500\n    result_rationale: >\n      Early termination 在 probe confidence > threshold 时终止 agent 执行。\n      threshold=0.3（aggressive）：在 42% 的轨迹上节省 tokens，但 12% 的成功轨迹被错误终止——\n      probe 将 exploratory phases 误判为 stagnation 导致 false termination。\n      threshold=0.5（balanced）：28% token savings, 5% success drop——更保守但仍有实用价值。\n      threshold=0.7（conservative）：15% savings, 2% drop——几乎只终止 high-confidence stagnation。\n      Median 档下这些 tradeoff 合理但不 dramatic：token savings 中等因为 stagnation \n      往往发生在轨迹中后期（已消耗大量 tokens），early termination 的绝对节省有限。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Early Termination Tradeoff\"\n        data: |\n          | Threshold | Tokens Saved | Success Drop | False Termination Rate |\n          |-----------|-------------|-------------|----------------------|\n          | 0.3       | 42%         | 12%         | 0.18                 |\n          | 0.5       | 28%         | 5%          | 0.08                 |\n          | 0.55 (opt)| 24%         | 3%          | 0.05                 |\n          | 0.7       | 15%         | 2%          | 0.03                 |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: x=success rate drop (%), y=tokens saved (%), 各 threshold 标点\"\n    analysis: >\n      Early termination 是 probe 的 downstream application，不是核心 contribution。\n      Optimal threshold（0.55）节省 24% tokens 而 success drop 仅 3%——实用但不 transformative。\n      论文在 Discussion 中简述即可，不宜过度展开。\n      这个结果也间接证明 probe 的校准性——confidence 与实际 stagnation 概率的 monotonic relationship。\n\n  - name: \"Interpretability Visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"interpretability\"\n    description: \"GRU hidden states 的 t-SNE/UMAP + attention 分析（如有）\"\n    expected_results:\n      tsne_silhouette_score: 0.42\n      umap_silhouette_score: 0.51\n      tsne_cluster_overlap_pct: 28\n      progress_cluster_centroid_distance: 2.34\n      stagnation_cluster_centroid_distance: 1.87\n      boundary_region_pct: 22\n      boundary_accuracy: 0.58\n      core_region_accuracy: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 silhouette=0.42/0.51 表明中等分离——两类在 embedding 空间中有明确趋势但重叠区域显著。\n      Overlap 28% 对应 gold set 上 20% 的错误率（probe gold F1=0.80）——\n      overlap 区域就是 probe 出错的主要来源。Boundary region（22%）精度仅 0.58，接近随机，\n      说明这些窗口本身 ambiguous。Core region（非 boundary）精度 0.94，高度可靠。\n      UMAP 优于 t-SNE 因为 UMAP 更好保留 global structure。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"t-SNE 散点图：GRU last hidden state，progress(蓝)/stagnation(红) 着色，标注 overlap zone\"\n      - \"UMAP 散点图：同上，展示更清晰的 global 结构\"\n      - \"Boundary vs core region accuracy 对比图\"\n    analysis: >\n      可视化主要用于 paper 的 qualitative analysis section。\n      核心 insight：probe 的 representational space 有清晰的 class structure，\n      但 boundary region 对应 progress/stagnation 定义本身的模糊性（与 annotator disagreement 重叠）。\n      建议在 appendix 放 t-SNE/UMAP，在 main text 引用 \"GRU hidden states show class-specific\n      clustering with an overlap region corresponding to inherently ambiguous windows\"。\n\n  - name: \"Human Annotation Gold Set\"\n    plan_id: \"human-annotation\"\n    description: \"400 窗口 × 3 annotators，Fleiss κ 评估，建立 gold standard\"\n    expected_results:\n      total_windows: 400\n      annotators: 3\n      fleiss_kappa: 0.68\n      pairwise_cohen_kappa: [0.65, 0.70, 0.69]\n      avg_pairwise_kappa: 0.68\n      gold_label_distribution_progress: 248\n      gold_label_distribution_stagnation: 152\n      gold_stagnation_rate: 0.38\n      clear_progress_kappa: 0.82\n      clear_stagnation_kappa: 0.78\n      ambiguous_windows_kappa: 0.45\n      ambiguous_windows_pct: 18\n      annotation_time_per_window_min: 4.5\n      total_annotation_hours: 90\n      mv_auto_label_agreement_with_gold_pct: 74\n      sampling_strategy: \"stratified by conf level and MV label\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      κ=0.68 属\"substantial agreement\"的下界，在 A6 假设范围 [0.60, 0.75] 内。\n      Progress 易标（κ=0.82）——明确的代码变更、测试通过、文件创建等。\n      Stagnation 较难（κ=0.78）但仍可接受——明确的重复、循环、报错。\n      Ambiguous windows（18%）κ=0.45——annotators 对\"探索性但可能无效的动作\"分歧严重。\n      Stagnation rate 0.38 比 auto labels 中的 0.285（15600/54809）更高，\n      因为 stratified sampling 有意 over-sample conf=1 和 stagnation candidate 窗口。\n      MV auto labels 与 gold 一致率 74%，说明 MV 标签整体偏 noisy 但方向正确。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: Inter-Annotator Agreement by Category\"\n        data: |\n          | Category            | #Windows | Fleiss κ  | Agreement % |\n          |---------------------|----------|-----------|-------------|\n          | Clear Progress      | 198      | 0.82      | 91%         |\n          | Clear Stagnation    | 130      | 0.78      | 87%         |\n          | Ambiguous           | 72       | 0.45      | 62%         |\n          | Overall             | 400      | 0.68      | 82%         |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: 3 annotators 的 confusion matrix（pairwise agreement）\"\n      - \"Distribution plot: gold label confidence（3/3 agree vs 2/3 majority）按 category\"\n    analysis: >\n      κ=0.68 是 borderline——NLP 标准通常要求 κ>0.70 for \"reliable\"。\n      论文应 (1) 报告 overall 和 per-category κ，(2) 讨论 ambiguous 类的低 agreement，\n      (3) 在 Limitations 中承认 gold set quality is \"substantial but not excellent\"。\n      Ambiguous 18% 的窗口可以 (a) 排除后重新评估，或 (b) 保留但 soft-label。\n      建议报告两个版本：full gold set（κ=0.68）和 filtered gold set（排除 ambiguous，κ=0.80+）。\n      在 filtered gold set 上 probe 的 performance 会更好看。\n\n  - name: \"LF Temporal Dynamics Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"lf-temporal-dynamics\"\n    description: \"各 LF 在 stagnation onset 的时序角色分析——temporal label model 的实证基础\"\n    expected_results:\n      command_rep_median_offset_steps: -1.8\n      command_rep_offset_std: 0.9\n      command_rep_cohens_d: 0.62\n      outcome_bp_median_offset_steps: 2.1\n      outcome_bp_offset_std: 1.3\n      outcome_bp_cohens_d: 0.45\n      diversity_drop_median_offset_steps: -1.2\n      diversity_drop_offset_std: 1.1\n      diversity_drop_cohens_d: 0.31\n      error_pattern_median_offset_steps: 0.3\n      error_pattern_offset_std: 0.8\n      error_pattern_cohens_d: 0.12\n      tool_misuse_median_offset_steps: -0.2\n      tool_misuse_offset_std: 1.0\n      tool_misuse_cohens_d: 0.08\n      significant_temporal_pairs: 2\n      significant_pair_1: \"command_rep → outcome_bp (Δ=3.9 steps, p<0.001)\"\n      significant_pair_2: \"diversity_drop → outcome_bp (Δ=3.3 steps, p<0.001)\"\n      stagnation_onset_windows_analyzed: 4820\n    result_rationale: >\n      A1 假设成立：LF 时序动态存在但 effect size 中等。\n      command_repetition 是最强 leading indicator（offset=-1.8, d=0.62）——agent 开始重复命令 \n      平均比其他 LF 早 1.8 步检测到 stagnation。这符合直觉：重复是 stagnation 最早的表面信号。\n      outcome_bp 是明确的 lagging indicator（offset=+2.1, d=0.45）——它依赖最终结果回溯，\n      天然滞后于实时 LFs。offset std=1.3 较大反映轨迹长度差异。\n      diversity_drop 弱 leading（offset=-1.2, d=0.31）——embedding 多样性下降比 explicit repetition 更微妙。\n      error_pattern 和 tool_misuse 几乎 concurrent（|offset|<0.5, d<0.15），时序分化不显著。\n      只有 2 个 LF pair（cmd_rep→outcome_bp, div_drop→outcome_bp）有 significant temporal separation——\n      这解释了 temporal LM 增益集中在少数 pair 的现象。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Table: LF Temporal Dynamics\"\n        data: |\n          | LF                  | Median Offset | Std   | Cohen's d | Role       | Significant? |\n          |---------------------|---------------|-------|-----------|------------|--------------|\n          | command_repetition  | -1.8 steps    | 0.9   | 0.62      | Leading    | Yes          |\n          | diversity_drop      | -1.2 steps    | 1.1   | 0.31      | Weak Lead  | Marginal     |\n          | tool_misuse         | -0.2 steps    | 1.0   | 0.08      | Concurrent | No           |\n          | error_pattern       | +0.3 steps    | 0.8   | 0.12      | Concurrent | No           |\n          | outcome_bp          | +2.1 steps    | 1.3   | 0.45      | Lagging    | Yes          |\n      - caption: \"Table: Significant LF Temporal Pairs\"\n        data: |\n          | Leading LF         | Lagging LF  | Δ Steps | p-value  |\n          |--------------------|-------------|---------|----------|\n          | command_repetition | outcome_bp  | 3.9     | <0.001   |\n          | diversity_drop     | outcome_bp  | 3.3     | <0.001   |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Timeline diagram: 典型 stagnation 序列中各 LF 的 activation 时序（示意图 + 实际数据 overlay）\"\n      - \"Violin plot: 各 LF 的 offset 分布，展示 spread 和 central tendency\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 temporal label model 的核心实证基础。结果支持 temporal awareness 的合理性，\n      但 effect size 中等意味着论文不能过度宣称 temporal dynamics 的 novelty。\n      只有 2/10 possible LF pairs 有 significant temporal separation——\n      这限制了 temporal LM 的普适性 claim。\n      论文应强调 (1) temporal dynamics 的存在是 domain insight（leading/lagging indicators），\n      (2) 这证明 i.i.d. 假设在 agent trajectory 上违反，\n      (3) 但承认 effect size 中等，temporal LM 的增量来自对少数关键 LF pair 的正确处理。\n      在 contribution framing 中，temporal dynamics analysis 本身可以作为 empirical finding，\n      即使 temporal LM 的 F1 增量不 dramatic。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"01ce48a8-b818-441f-8500-04c3a5304419","total_cost_usd":1.02995275,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12725,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":37467,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12725,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":37467,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12725,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12725},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":7691,"outputTokens":25,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.007816,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":37467,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":12725,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.02213675,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"6120f987-55ce-4c84-a432-56dccbb26530"}
